<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ikitabu ya attu o waamulha</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikitabu ya attu o waamulha</para>
  <para style="toc2">O waamulha</para>
  <para style="toc3">Waam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikitabu ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">attu o waamulha</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Attu o Uisraeli arimeelheke Nayoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Arimeelheke Nayoshua, attu o Uisraeli ahaakoha Apwiiya Nlhuku wo wiira, “Apwiiya Nlhuku nnihimerieke nikosho naani ninohalha uholhelha urwaa waatakana ni attu o ilhapo yo Ukanaani?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Paahi, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhulha yeeraka, “Attu o nikosho ni Nayuda phi ninohalha uholhelha urwaa waatakana ni yayo attu ayo, ukhalhawaya kihomalha waavaha machiri o waakottolha wo nlhatu waya.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Attu o nikosho ni Nayuda nkayeerelhacha ashilhoko aya attu o nikosho ni Nasimioni wiira, “Mmweeke mwaanikaviha, navare ilhapo nivahiye ihu iyo. Ni hii ninoukavihani ukusha ilhapo inohalha inyu uvahiya iyo.” Paahi, nkayaawa ni waakaviha. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Paahi attu o nikosho ni Nayuda nkayaarwa waatakana ni attu o Ukaanani ni o Uperizi. Ni Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayooriha waakottolha, ni weevakacha attu maelufu khumi ukhotoni, wi iwani yo Ubezeki uwo. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Wowo wiilhaponi uwo nkayaaphwanya amwene Naadonibezeki, nkayaatakanana ni waakottolha. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Paahi Naadonibezeki ahottawa, nansho ahotwariya, nkaavariya, nkaatupulhiya makokho molhupalhe o mmiononi ni o mmietoni. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Naadonibezeki nkeera, “Mamwene makhumi saba kaatupunlhe aka makokho molhupalhe o mmiononi ni o mmietoni, aholhokhottacha mahalha wuuthi imeza aka. Vano, Nlhuku hokilhiva thoko chipannge aka.” Nkaarwehiya Uyerusalemu, nkayaarimeelha wowo.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Attu o nikosho ni Nayuda anookottolha ilhapo cho Uyerusalemu, Uhebroni ni ilhapo chikina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Attu o nikosho ni Nayuda nkayaakelhelha iwani yo Uyerusalemu ni uvara mateeka. Nkayeevakacha attu aakhalha mwommo ayo, wo waakhapakacha ni uphanga ni upaha mooro ilhapo iyo. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Kaanyuma, attu o nikosho ni Nayuda ahorwaa waatakana ni attu o Ukanaani aakalha ilhapo yo umiakoni, ni Unegebu, ilhapo yo uhikhalhe ni miako. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Tho, nkayaatakacha attu o Ukanaani anokhalha iwani yo Uhebroni, weehaniya khalhai vawo Kiriath arba, nkayaatakacha ni attu o makosho a Asheshai, Ahimani ni Atalmai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naothinieli anookottolha iwani yo Udebiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOS 15:13-19">Nayos 15:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Athameke wowo attu o nikosho ni Nayuda ahorwaacha waatakana ni attu o iwani yo Udebiri, yeehaniya khalhai vawo Kiriathseferi. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Nakalebu nkayaakhuwelha yiiraka wiira, “Ntu riyoothe nohalha wooria uvara mateeka iwani yo Kiriathseferi, kinonthelhiha mwaamwanaka mwanthiyana Aksa.”<verse eid="JDG 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Paahi Naothnieli, mwaana a Nakenazi, ahima aya Nakalebu, ahovara mateeka iwani iyo. Paahi etu Nakalebu nkayankumiha mwaamwanaya mwanthiyana Aksa wiira athelhiye ni Naothnieli. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Paahi Aksa uyo vaaphiilhe awe, aheerelha Naothnieli, wiira “Waavekelheke imata athumwanaka.” Vavawo, Aksa oolhumacha nari vachulhu iphuta. Vaakhuruwilhe awe vathi athumwanawe nkankoha, “Inothanana kuuvaheke ittu yaani?”<verse eid="JDG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Nkaakhulha wo wiira, “Nkivaheke izawadi marapo o maashi, ukhalhawaya imata ikivahilhe inyu Unegebu uwo yo wuuma, khaawo maashi.” Paahi Nakalebu ahommaha imata marapo ari uchulhu ni umakooteni.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukottolha waapantte aya attu o makosho a Nayuda ni Nabenyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Ayari a Nakeni, ari ahokohaya ashinna Musa, ahottukana ni attu o nikosho ni Nayuda ukhuma iwani yo miri cho Mitende, yaani ilhapo yo Uyeriko, mpaka uthako wo Uyuda, Unegebu vakhiviru ni Uaradi, nkayaapangacha nipuro naya wowo vamoka ni attu o ilhapo i Nayuda. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Attu o nikosho ni Nayuda ahokavihana ni ashilhoko aya attu o nikosho ni Nasimioni, nkayaakottolha attu o Ukanaani aakhalha Usefathi. Nkayaalhakalhiha ilhapo iyo ni unvaha nchina nikina, ni wiihaniya Horma. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Attu o nikosho ni Nayuda ni ayo nkayaavara mateeka iwani yo Ugaza ni ittoko chaya chonkhaye, Uashkeloni ni vakittu vaya vonkhaye ni Uekroni ni vakittu vaya vonkhaye. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ari vamoka ni attu o nikosho ni Nayuda, ni ayo nkayaavara mateeka ilhapo yo umiakoni. Nansho khayoonrie waakottolha anenchi o ilhapo yo uhikhalhe miako iyo, ukhalhawaya nkukuta chaya cho waatakanelha ikhoto chaari cho yuuma. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Yamalhekeru, Nakalebu ahovahiya ilhapo yo Uhebroni, thoko cheera aya malhehero a ashinna Musa. Nakalebu nkayoomolhacha ukhuma wowo mahimo mararu a Naanaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Nansho attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini khayoomolhanche Ayebusi anookhalhacha iwani yo Uyerusalemu, phi maana etu Ayebusi anokhalha vamoka ni attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini, Uyerusalemu mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Attu o makosho a Naefraimu ni Namanase anookottolha iwani yo Ubetheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Attu o nikosho ni Nayosefu nkayaakelhelha iwani yo Ubetheli, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku arii vamoka ni ayo. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Wo uchokholha, ahaaruma attu o uhotelha arwee ahotelhe iwani yo Ubetheli, yeehaniya khalhai vawo Luzi. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Paahi yayo attu o uhotelha ayo vaamwonne aya ntu mmoka akhumaka vawani vawo, ahomwiirelha wiira, “Nnoonihe iphiro inokelha vawani, ni hii khaninoupangelhani ittu yo uhilhoka.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Ni uyo ahooniha iphiro yo ukelhelha vawani vawo. Paahi nkayaakelha ni urimeelhiha kila ntu arii mwommo. Nansho nkayanhiya ntu ulhe nkumi, yoyo vamoka ni ashilhoko awe. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Paahi yoyo ntu uyo nkaathamelha ilhapo ya attu o Uhiti, wowo nkaatheka iwani yeehaniye Luzi, ni ilhapo iyo ineehaniya chiicho mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Attu ahoomolhachiye ni attu o Uisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Paahi attu o nikosho ni Namanase nkayoomolhanche attu o iwani yo Ubethsheani ni ittoko chaya, o Utanaki ni ittoko chaya, o Udori ni ittoko chaya. attu o Ukanaani nkayaathepa ukhalhacha wowo. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Ata Aisraeli vaari aya ni machiri khayoomolhanche attu o Ukanaani, nansho ahaavarihacha mitheko wo waakhanyereriha.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu khayoomolhanche attu o Ukanaani anokhalha Ugezeri uwo, ni ayo ahokhalha wowo vamoka ni attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Attu o nikosho ni Nazabuloni khayoomolhanche attu o iwani yo Ukitroni, mena alhe o iwani yo Nahalali, ahothepa waakhalhana vamoka ni waavariha mitheko thoko ipotta.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Attu o nikosho ni Naasheri khayoomolhanche attu o iwani cho Uako, Usidoni, Ualabu, Uakizibu, Uhlabu, Uafeka ni Urehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Attu o nikosho ni Naasheri ahokhalhacha vamoka ni attu o Ukanaani, anenchi o yeyo ilhapo iyo kwaani khayoomolhanche.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Attu o nikosho ni Nanaftali khayoomolhanche attu o iwani yo Ubeth Shemeshi ama anenchi o Ubeth Anathi, nansho ahaakhalhana vamoka. Nansho anenchi o ilhapo iyo, ahaakhanyereriha attu o Uisraeli avarache mitheko cho ukhanyererihiya.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Aamori nkayomoolhachera attu o nikosho ni Unadani umiakoni. Nkayaatiyelhelha wiira ahikhuruwe uukhalhani vathi uhiri miako. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Paahi Aamori nkayaathepa ukhalha ilhapo cho umiakoni cho Uheresi, Uaiyaloni ni Ushaalbimu. Nansho attu o makosho a Namanase ni Naefraimu ahaatawara Aamori ni waapanga anamitheko wo waakhanyereriha.<verse eid="JDG 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Mwiinano wa Aamori waari mpata wo nchulhu wo Usela, unolhapuwelha mphitho Uakarimu ni uthepa.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Nnepa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku Ubokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Yamalheke, nnepa wo wiirimu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ahowelha ukhuma Ugalgali urwaa Ubokimu. Nkayeerelha wiira, “Mii kihoukumihani mwaatti ukhuma ilhapo yo Umisri, ni uwiihani mpaka ilhapo kaalhupenlhe aka manyaathumwaninyu, venre aka wiira, ‘Akinontha nenno nlhove naka nno kaalhupenlhe aka ni inyu mwaatti nno mena. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Ni inyu mwaatti nhilhehane nlhove nirinoothe nne, ni alha attu o ilha ilhapo ilha. Mpomolhacheke madhubahu aya.’ Nansho khamwaarumelhenlhe nlhove naka, nhorukunusha. <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Paahi wo nlhatu wa alha mii kineera wiira: Akinoomolhacha anenchi wiira athamache umihoolho winyu, nansho anoouhomachani thoko mwiiwa mmapararini mwinyu, ni milhuku chaya chinouwayihani vanothimichiya inyu.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Nnepa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku uyo wamalhiheke wulhumacha malhove alha, attu o Uisraeli onkhaye ahokhuwelhacha ni wunlha, <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />nkayeehana vavawo vakittu vawo Bokimu maana aya ikutto, Yamalheke nkayaakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Urimeelha u Nayoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Paahi Nayoshua amalhiheke waalheha attu, kila mmoka ahorwaa vakittu vaameelhiye awe wiira vakhalhe vawawe. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Yayo attu o Uisraeli ayo nkayaavara ntheko wa waatumikelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mahuku onkhaye a Nayoshua, ni baada yo urimeelha, aheera chiicho ikatema yonkhaye yaalhokenlhe aya manyaashulhupalhe aya aahanlhe, oonilhe mitheko chulhupalhe cha Apwiiya Nlhuku chaapangenlhe aya attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Nayoshua anaaya Nanuni, namitheko a Apwiiya Nlhuku, aarimenlhe anari ni malhipa o iyaakha imia imoka ni khumi. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Nkayaavithiya vakittu vameelhiye aya ukhalha vawaya Utimnath Heresi uwo, ilhapo yo umiakoni yo Efraimu, mpata wo uchulhu wo Ugaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Yamalheke vavawo attu onkhaye o iyari aya ahorimeelha, nkayaatwara iyari ikina yahaachuwenlhe Apwiiya Nlhuku, mena mitheko chaapangilhe aya wa attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Attu o Uisraeli anowaakhota Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Paahi, attu o Uisraeli ahopangacha chittu cho uhilhoka umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni uthimicha Mabaali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Ahaahiya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a manyaapwiiya aya, aakuminhe ukhuma ilhapo yo Umisri, nkayaatwaracha milhuku chikina, milhuku chaathimichiya ni attu anokhalhacha nchereshere mwaya. Nkayaakhoromelha chechiyo milhuku chiyo, nkayaathunalhiha Apwiiya Nlhuku chinene. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Ahaahiya Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkayaathimicha Mabaali ni Maashithtarothi. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Paahi etu, urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ahothepa chinene vachulhu wa attu o Uisraeli, ni ayo nkayaahiya attu o uvara makhuche aathurulhache mihakhu chaya. Nkayaahiya wiira akottolhachiye ni amalhaponi aya aarukurerianche, ata ahoorie tho waavinga. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Ni kila nkwaha waarwelhe aya waatakana ikhoto, moono wa Apwiiya Nlhuku waari vachulhu waya ni waahelha mariro, thoko chaalhenlhe aya ni ulhupelha. Ni ayo nkayaakhalha ni ihuzuni yulhupalhe.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaavahacha attu o waamulha milhatu yookhonlhe ukhuma mmiononi mwa attu aathurunlhe nhakhu aya alhe. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Nansho ata inakhalhaka chiicho, attu o Uisraeli khayewelhenlhe attu o waamulha ayo, ukhalhawaya ahopanga thoko attu o ishembwere wo uttwara milhuku chikina ni uthimicha. Ahohiya chitema chittu chaapangilhe aya manyaapwiiya aya, aarumelhenlhe malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku, nansho ayo khaapangilhe chiicho. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Kila nkwaha Apwiiya Nlhuku vaarwehilhe aya attu o waamulha, yayo anene ayo ari vamoka ni ntu o waamulha uyo, nkayookholhiya mmiononi mwa amalhaponi aya wo ikatema yonkhaye yo ukumi wa ntu o waamulha uyo. Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoonelha ikiriri veewilhe aya ikutto aya yo uhuvihiya waya ni waakhiya mihakhu waapangelhiye aya. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Nansho kila ikatema ntu o waamulha vaakhwilhe awe, ahohokholhelhacha chittu chaapanga aya mpacho chiyo, yaari attu o uphanga chittu cho uhilhoka chihipangiye ni manyaapwiya aya. Ahotwaracha milhuku ikina, nkayaanthimichera ni ukhoromelha, mena kaahilhe mitheko chaya chaapanganche aya mpacho mena uhiya itiyamaru aya. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Paahi urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ahothepa vachulhu wa attu o Uisraeli, nkayeerelha wiira, “Ukhalhawaya yalha attu alha ahohiya malhehano khalhehanne aka ni mwanyaapwiiya aya, nkayaakhota urumelhelha nlhove naka, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />akinoomolha tho etu makosho arii aahalhihiye ni Nayoshua, ikatema yaarimenlhe aya. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Ni mii toka vano kinowaaruma yayo makosho ayo waalhikacha attu o Uisraeli koone yakhalhaka anokihokholhelha ni ukithimicha thoko manyaapwiiya aya ama kuhiwena.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku ahohalhiha yayo makosho ayo, mena khoomonlhe wiira athamache wo waakuvia, mena kaavahilhe achishana a Nayoshua machiri o ukottolha yayo makosho ayo.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Makosho ahalhenlhe mwiilhaponi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Paahi etu, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahohalhiha alha makosho alha wiira aalhikache attu o Uisraeli arii ahinaatakana ikhoto mwiilhaponi Ukanaani. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Aapangilhe chiicho wiira aachuwelhihe attu o iyari chiyo, ikhoto chineera aya wo waatakaniya, ukhalhawaya ari ahinaya woona ikhoto. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Attu aahanlhe mwiilhaponi mmo ari aholheli o ilhapo nthanu cha Afilisti, Ukanaani, Usidini, ni attu o Hivi aakhalha umiakoni Lebanoni ukhuma mwaako wo Baali hermoni mpaka uphiya Uhamathi. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Apwiiya Nlhuku aapangilhe yayo wiira aalhikache attu o Uisraeli, koone yakhalhaka anoorumelhelhacha malhehero aya aalhehenre aya manyaashulhupalhe aya wo iphiro ya ashinna Musa. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli ahokhalhacha vamoka ni attu o Ukanaani, attu o Uhiti, Aamori, attu o Uperizi, attu o Hivi, ni Ayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Nkayaaveka imialhi chaya ni waavekiha ni ayo imialhi chaya wa ashimirawo o chechiyo ilhapo chiyo ni uthimichera milhuku aya.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Naothinieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Attu o Uisraeli ahaalhiyalha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku aya ni uwonya umihoolho waya, nkayaathimicha Maabaali ni Maashera. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku ahorushiya wo chittu chaapanga aya attu o Uisraeli, ni ayo nkayaahiya wiira akottolhiye ni amwene Kushan rishath Aimu o Mesopotamiya, ni ayo nkayaatawaracha iyaakha nane. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli nkayonlhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni ayo nkayaarwehelha ntu anohalha woopolha yaani, Othnieli mwaana a Nakenazi, mwanhima aya mwankani Nakalebu. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Paahi Iphumu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku yahaakhuruwelha Naothnieli, ni ayo nkayaakhalha ntu o waamulha milhatu a attu o Uisraeli. Naothnieli ahorwaa ukhotoni, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayooriha wakottolha amwene Nakushan Rishathaimu o Umesopotamiya. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Paahi mpuha nkayaakhalha mwiilhaponi iyaakha makhumi ncheshe. Yamalheke Naothnieli anaaya Nakenazi ahorimeelha.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaaha u Naehudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli ahowonya tho umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaavaha machiri amwene Naegloni o Umoabu wiira aate attu o Uisraeli, wo nlhatu no uwonya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Ni ayo Nagloni nkayaakumaniha attu o Uamoni ni attu o Uamaleki, nkayaarwaa waatakana ni attu o Uisraeli, nkayaakottolha. Nkayaavara mateeka iwani yo miri cho Mitende yaani iwani yo Uyeriko. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Attu o Uisraeli nkayaatawariya ni amwene Naegloni o ilhapo Umoabu, iyaakha khumi ni nane.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Nansho attu o Uisraeli volhenlhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, aarweehelhiya ntu o wookholha. Yayo ari Naehudi anaaya Nagera, ntu o moono wo wiimushi wo machiri, aakhuma nikosho ni Nabenyamini. Attu o Uisraeli nkayaaruma yayo arweehe izawadi chaya wa amwene Naegloni o Umoabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Paahi Naehudi nkayeekoroshelha uphanga wo wiithia uno ni uno, wo urekama isitimita makhumi nthanu. Nkayaattuka nnyuununi mwaya wiimonono nhina ikuwo chaya. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Yamalheke nkayaarwehelha Naegiloni izawadi chilhe. Naegloni ayo ari ntu o uritimalha chinene. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Amalhiheke ukumiha izawadi chilhe, nkayeerelha attu akunshe izawadi alhe wiira ahokolhiacheke uwannyaya. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Nansho Naehudi vaaphilhe aya varii isinyago cho malhuku chaahimiye vakhiviru ni iwani yo Ugilgali, ahohokolhia wa amwene Naegloni ni weerelha wiira, “Pwiiya, kihanaa nttenga kinothanana aka uhimeriani wo nivitho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Amwene nkayeerelha anamitheko aya wiira athamache, ni ayo nkayaakhumacha vathe.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Paahi Naehudi nkayaatameria vakittu aakhanlhe aya amwene uchumbani waya wo uririiya, upirothi, nkayeerelha wiira, “Kihanaa nttenga inyu ukhuma wa Nlhuku.” Amwene nkonkwa uhicheni aakhanlhe aya ni weemelha. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Naehudi nkayaatholholha uphanga aya waari nnyuununi wiimonono waya, ni wo moono aya wo wiimushi nkayaahoma vanthunkwani wa amwene Naegloni. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Uphanga uyo nkawaakelha nhina vamoka ni mmini aya, makhura nkaakhunelha uphanga uyo, kwaani Naehudi kaakumihilhe tho, nkawaakhumelhelha utulhi. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Yamalheke, Naehudi ahokhuma vathe vapirothi vawo, baada yo uttia mikhora cho uchumbani mmo ni mihulhelho.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Paahi Naehudi vaathamme aya, akarumiya a amwene ahohokolhiacha. Vonne aya mikhora chonkhaye cho uchumbani chihotteiya, nkaanyiheracha wiira akenlhe urindini, mwommo mpani mmo. <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Nkayaaweherera mpaka nkayaachokholha ukelhiya ni nipampa. Voonne aya wiira kanhulha, yahokushacha mihulhelho ni uhulha nlhako. Nkayaaphwanya amwene aya anarumpe vathi, anakhwilhe.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Naehudi nkayaatoroka attu ayo vaari aya athepaka uweherera. Nkaavira vaari isinyago cho malhuku, nkayaattawelha Useiri. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Vaaphilhe aya wowo wi ilhapo yo miako yo Efraimu, ahoopa nipalhapata no weesha attu tayari wo waatakana ikhoto, ni attu o Uisraeli ahokhuruwacha vamoka ukhuma wowo umiakoni uwo, ni ayo ahaaholhelha. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Nkayeerelhacha wiira, “Nkittwareke, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaakottolha amalhaponi inyu attu o Umoabu.” Attu nkayaatwaracha mpaka vaalhapuwiya mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, ni uvara ukhuma wa attu o Umoabu, ni waatiyelhelha attu wiira ahivire ntu riyoothe wowo.<verse eid="JDG 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Nenno nihuku nno nkayeeva Amoabu elufu khumi, attu onkhaye arii o machiri ni iruttu cho ukhomaalha, mena khaawo ata mmoka aahanlhe. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Nenno nihuku nenno attu o Uisraeli nkayaakottolha Amoabu, ilhapo nkayaakhalha ni mpuha wo iyaakha makhumi nane.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaaha u Nashamgari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Tho, baada ya Naehudi, Nashamgari anaaya Naanati, ahokusha nipuro naya. Yayo aheeva Afilisti imia sita wo ikopo yo uchungelha ing'ope. Tho etu, ahookholha attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Nadebora ni Nabaraka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Arimeelheke Naehudi, attu o Uisraeli ahowonya tho umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaahiya wiira akottolhiye ni Nayabini, amwene o Ukanaani, aakhalha iwani yo Uhazori. Nholhelhi o miphingo chaya cha manyaasikari ari Nasisera, ntu o Uharosheth Hagoimu. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Amwene Nayabini ari ni nkukuta cho ikhoto cho upurulhiya ni ashinama imia tisa. Yayo ahaatawara attu o Uisraeli wo waamereriha chinene, wo iyaakha makhumi meelhi. Ni attu o Uisraeli aholhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira oonelhe ikiriri.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Paahi yeyo ikatema iyo ahokhalha namilhohi nthiyana ehaniya Debora, ahanu a Nalapidothi. Yayo Nadebora ayo ari ntu o waamulha milhatu a attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Nadebora ari ni aavara ntheko aya wo ukhalha vantendeni, ntende waari variyari iwani yo Uraama ni iwani yo Ubetheli, wi ilhapo yo miako cho Efraimu. Attu o Uisraeli ahowaacha vavawo wiira aamulhelhe milhatu chaya. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Nihuku nimoka Nadebora aheehana Nabaraka anaaya Naabinoamu o Ukedeshi ilhapo yo Unaftali. Vaawiilhe aya, nkayeerelha wiira, “Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli, anouhulhelhani wiira, ‘Nrweeke mwaathothokanihe attu inyu umwaakoni Utabori, mwaathanlheke attu elufu khumi ukhuma makosho a Nanaftali ni Nazabuloni. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Ni mii kinowaahachulhacha Nasisera, nholhelhi o manyaasikari a Nayabini, wiira aweeke ni nkukuta chaya aatakane ikhoto ni inyu mwaatti, umwoolhokoni Kishoni, ni inyu mmweeke mwaakottolha.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Nabarak nkayaakhulha Nadebora wo wiira, “Mwakittukanaka, kinoorwaa, nansho mwaahikittukaneke, akinorwaa.”<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Paahi Nadebora nkayaakulha wo wiira, “Eiyo kinorwaa vamoka ni inyuva, nansho khannothimichiya vakittu variwoothe, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku, anommaha nthiyana machiri o waakottolha Nasisera.” paahi Nadebora nkayaatwarana ni Nabarak urwaa Ukadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Nabaraka nkayeehana makosho a Nanaftali ni Nazabuloni wowo Ukedeshi uwo, ni attu maelufu khumi ahotwaracha. Nadebora nkayarwaa vamoka ni ayo.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Yeyo ikatema iyo, Naheberi, o ukhuma ilhapo yo Ukeni, ari aneemeshilhe nihema naya utayi, uri mwiri muulhupalhe wo Uzananimu, vakhiviru ni Ukedeshi, anekuminhe munlhokoni mwa Aakeni nanaya, achishana a Nahobabu, alhamu aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Attu nkayeerelha Nasisera wiira Nabaraki anaaya Naabinoamu ahowelha umwaakoni Utabori, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />ahothukumana miphingo chonkhaye vamoka ni nkukuta chaya imia tisa cho yuuma, nkayaathama Uharosheth Hagoimu, nkayaarwa umwoolhokoni Kishoni.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Nadebora nkayeerelha Nabaraka wiira, “Munkweke! Lhelho phi nihuku Apwiiya Nlhuku vanonivaha aya machiri o waakottolha Nasisera. Apwiiya Nlhuku anoorwa umihoolho winyu.” Paahi Nabaraka ahokhuruwa umwaakoni Utabori, aholhelhaka attu aya maelufu khumi. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Nabaraka vaakelhenlhe aya ni mphingo aya, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaatutuwanyiha Nasisera ni miphingo chaya chonkhaye. Paahi Nasisera nkayaakhuruwa munkukutani mwaya, nkayaattawa wo mweto. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Nansho Nabaraka ni ayo nkayaatwara miphingo chiyo wo nkukuta mpaka Uharosheth Hagoimu ni weeva manyaasikari a Nasisera onkhaye wo waakhapakacha ni maphanga, wo uhinhalhiha ata ntu mmoka.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Nansho Nasisera aattawilhe wo mweto mpaka unihemani wa Nayaeli, ahanu a Naheberi, ntu o ilhapo yo Ukeni. Aapannge chiicho ukhalhawaya waari wiiwananiyaka wo mpuha munlhokoni mwa amwene Nayabini o Uhazori, ni manyaalhoko a Naheberi. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Nayaeli ahokhuma ni weekamelhani Nasisera, nkayeerelha wiira, “Pwiiya, kharibu uwannyaka, ni wala nhoove.” Paahi nkaakelha unihemani mwaya, nkayaakhunelha niblangeti. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Nasisera nkayeerelha Nayaeli wiira, “Chonte, nkivahe maashi vakani kiwurie, ukhalhawaya kirini nttona.” Nayaeli nkayaavaha Nasisera mapelhe baada yo maashi, Yamalheke nkayaakhunelha tho. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Nasisera nkeera, “Mweemelheke vankhorani wo nihema vawo. Ntu riyoothe awaaka ukohani wiira ahaawo ntu riyoothe va, mwiireke wiira khaawo.”<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Ukhalhawaya Nasisera ari anoochelhe chinene, ahorupa ikhove. Vavawo, Nayaeli, ahanu a Naheberi, ahokusha ikhomo yo nihema ni inuto. Nkayaarwaa nrimanrima vakani vakani nkayaakomelhelha ikhomo yo nihema iyo vayuchi wa Nasisera, nkayaaperetta mpaka uttayani, ni Nasisera nkayaakhwa vavawo. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Ni Nabaraka vaari aya aatwarelhelhaka Nasisera, Nayaeli ahokhuma vathe ni weekamelhani, nkayeerelha wiira, “Nkawaani kuwoniheni ntu nnomwavia inyu.” Paahi Nabaraki ahokelha nnihemani mu Nayaeli ni woona Nasisera anarumpe vathi, ni ikhomo yo nihema inakhomelhiye vayuchi waya.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Paahi etu nenno nihuku nno Nlhuku nkaavahera attu o Uisraeli waakottolha amwene Nayabini o Ukanaani <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Attu o Uisraeli nkayaathepacha waakukutta ni waakottolha amwene Nayabini, o Ukanaani, mpaka vaarimelhinhe aya.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Ichipo ni Nadebora ni Baraki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Nenno nihuku nno Nadebora ni Nabaraki, anaaya Nabinoamu, nkayeepa nna Ichipo nna:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Athimichiye Apwiiya Nlhuku!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">Attu o Uisraeli, aheekumiha wiira aatakane ikhoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">ni attu aheekumiha wo nrima aya wo uteelhiya.<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Mwiiwelhelheke inyu mamwene!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Mwiiwelhelheke rata, mwaatti nri manyaashulhupalhe va!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Kinowiipa Ichipo, weepelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Inyuva Apwiiya Nlhuku, vaathamme inyu Useiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">vaakhuruwilhe inyu mwaako wo Uedomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">ilhapo yahotetemelha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">irimu ahomoriha maashi, eiyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">mahute ahoruphiha iphulha.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Miako chahotikhinyia umihoolho winyu Apwiiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">eiyo, mwaako wo Usinai umihoolho winyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mahuku a Nashamgari, anaaya Naanathi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">ikatema i Nayaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">miphingo chahohiya uvira mwiilhaponi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">anamikwaha ahovira vachereshere.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Anamalhima ahohiyacha ulhima, ahohiya ulhima tho Uisraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">mpaka mii Debora veemenlhe aka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">mii kirii thoko anaangoro a attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Aheethanlhelha milhuku cho naanano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">nkayaakhalha ikhoto velhaponi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Nansho khaakhanlhe ntu aavanre nivaka ama ntu o aavanre ichikopa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">munlhokoni mwa attu maelufu makhumi ncheshe o attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Nrima aka unowaatotopelha aholhelhi o miphingo cha attu o Uisraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">eekumihilhe wo nrima waya munlhokoni mwa attu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Athimichiye Apwiiya Nlhuku!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Nhimiacheke mwaatti inyu nnowelha iphuta cho teelha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">inyu nnokhalhelha matandiko o nhakhu mwinchi anaathalhiya mmithanani mwa ashinama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">mwaatti inyu nneeta mmaphironi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">nkuwelhecheke nno nhimiaka ittu iyo.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Mwiiweke, attu enchi mmalhushi, anowiipacha ahimiachaka machiri ya Apwiiya Nlhuku, machiri wa anamalhima aya o Uisraeli.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Phi vavawo, attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku vaakhuruwachilhe aya mmilhakoni.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Munkweke, Nadebora munkweke!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Munkweke, munkweke mwiipeke Ichipo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Munkweke Nabaraki anaaya Naabinoamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">mwaakusheke attu mwaavanre inyu mateeka.<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Attu o machiri aahanlhe ahokhuruwacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku yaarwelhe waatakanelha wa attu o machiri.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Ukhuma u Naefraimu ahokhuruwacha unikoteni, nkayaatwaracha achihima aya attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">ukhuma Umakiri ahokhuruwa manyaaholhelhi o miphingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">ukhuma nikosho ni Nazabuloni ahowa mamwene manyaaholhelhi olhupalhe chinene.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Manyaaholhelhi o nikosho ni Naisakari, nkayaattukana Nadebora,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">eiyo, attu a Naisakari nkayaattukana Nabaraki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">nkayaattwaracha wo waakuvia mpaka unikoteni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Nansho attu o nikosho ni Narobeni ahomwalhaana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Khachuwenlhe chinohalha aya ukhumaana.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Wo nlhatu waani etu no ukhalha utulhi ikhondoro?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Wiira eewe nlhove no nshunga vaneehana awe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Eiyo, mmilhokoni mwo attu o nikosho ni Narobeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">wahokhalha nrima wo umwalhaanacha.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Nikosho ni Nagileadi nahohalha ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Nlhatuni mwaatti attu o nikosho ni Unadani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">mwahohalha wo uhikhuruwa nkalhavani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Attu o nikosho ni Naasheri nahomaalha shiriri uchengweni uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">nahokhalha uchengweni uneemeshiya ikalhava uwo.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Nansho attu o makosho a Nazabuloni ni Nanaftali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">phi attu yaahenlhe ukumi aya ntatakoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">wowo wi ipuwa yo waatakaniya ikhoto uwo.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Wowo Naanaki uwo, vachereshere marapo o Umegido uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">mamwene ahowaacha nkayeesha nipuro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">mamwene o ilhapo yo Ukanaani ahaatakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">nansho khaapatilhe chittu cho malhuku o isiliva mena uvara mateeka.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Ittotwa cho wiirimu chahatakana ikhoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">chahottwara iphiro chaya, nkachaatakana ni Sisera.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Mawambwe o mwoolhoko wo Kishoni ahaakhupa mpaka utayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">eiyo, mawambwe molhupalhe o mwoolhoko wo Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Kinoochusha umihoolho wo machiri aka!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />A farasi ahoviracha eetaka wo ikhito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">ahothipacha ittaya wo ikhito cho inyaa chaya.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Nnepa wo wiirimu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku neera cho, “Mwaalhaveke attu o ilhapo yo Umerose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">mwaalhaveke attu o ilhapo aya, ukhalhawaya khaawachilhe uwaakavihani attu a Apwiiya Nlhuku, waatakana ni attu o machiri.”<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Avahiye ibarakha Nayaeli ahanu a Naheberi ntu o Ukeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">waapwaha manyaathiyana onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Eiyo, ahovahiya ibarakha waapwaha manyaathiyana onkhaye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">anokhalhacha mmaheemani.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Nasisera aavekelhe maashi, nansho ayo nkayaavaha mapelhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">nkayaawiihera mapelhe o lhemelha, aahelhiye nnyiponi mworera.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Wiimushi aavanre ikhomo yo nihema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">ni wiimonono waya aavanre inuto, nkayaanyata Nasisera vamuruni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">nkayampwesha ni umparulha vayuchi.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Nasisera ahooroma ni uwulhuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">nkaarupa wo uhitikhinyia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">vamietoni waya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Vooromme aya vawo, phi vavawo vaawulhuwilhe aya anakhwilhe!<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Anumwanaya Nasisera ahothurumelha vandirishani, nkayonlha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Chani woonaka anoopicha uhokolhia?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Woonaka khanineewa nkukuta chaya cho upurulhiya ni ashinama chihokolhiaka?<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Nkayaakhulhiya ni manyaathiyana o irusho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">Nkayeemalhiha tho ni tho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">wo wowo waakhulhiya waakhulhiye aya uwo.<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />Veekinaka kapatilhe mateeka ni ukawana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">mwalhi mmoka ama eelhi wo kila nsikari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ikuwo yo sufu yo rangi wo nlhatu ni Nasisera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Ikuwo yo isufu nittaviye rata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ni mitandio miilhi cho uphwanelhiha ishiko aka!<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Inyuva Apwiiya Nlhuku, arimeelhache amalhaponi inyu onkhaye! Nansho manyampwana inyu apharelheke thoko nchuwa! Ikatema vanokhuma aya wo nchakarimia mulhupalhe!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Ni ilhapo iyo nkayaakhalha ni mpuha wo iyaakha makhumi ncheshe.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Nagidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Yamalheke, attu o Uisraeli ahowonya tho umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ni ayo nkaahiya, nkayaakottolhiya ni utawariya ni attu o Umidiani iyaakha saba. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Attu o Umidiani yahaamereriha attu o Uisraeli mpaka nkayethipelha malhikiti ni miithe umiakoni wiira chikhalhe mangome aya. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Paahi kila nkwaha attu o Uisraeli vaalhanche aya imbeyu umatani, attu o Umidiani, attu o Uamaleki ni attu akina o wowo unosha nchuwa uwo, ahowa ni waatakacha. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Yayo makosho ayo aheeshacha mapuro aya mwiilhaponi mmo. Nkayaakelhelha ni utanganya choolhia chonkhaye velhaponi mpaka umwiinanoni mwo ilhapo yo Ugaza, wo uhaahiyera attu o Uisraeli ittu iriyoothe ilhe, ikhalhe ikhondoro, ing'ope ama iphuta. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Amalhaponi alhemalhenlhe uwa wo mikutiro thoko nashombe, vamoka ni ing'ope ni ingamiya chaya ni uphanga nipuro naya wilhaponi mwa attu o Uisraeli, ahotanganyacha ilhapo ya attu o Uisraeli, ukhalhawaya ari attu enchi chinene ahinaalhakelhia. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Attu o Uisraeli ahohelhiya umashikini chinene ni attu o Umidiani, nkayonlhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira aakavihe.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli vaamalhinhe aya wonlhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira aathamihere uhuva waapatilhe aya wa attu o Umidiani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaarwehelha namitheko, ni uyo nkaahimiacha nttenga wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli eera, “Kahoukumihani ilhapo yo Umisri mwaari inyu upottani, <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />nkakowookholhani ukhuma mmiononi mwa attu o Umisri onkhaye, owaamererihani. Nkakomoolhacha attu vaawa inyu, ni uvahani inyuva ilhapo chaya. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Yamalheke kahowupushani wiira mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, ni wiira nhithimiche milhuku ya Aamori, nkushilhe aya ilhapo aya, nansho khamwiiwelhelhe nlhove naka.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Nnepa o wiirimu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaarwa Uofra, nkonkoma wuuthi mwiri muulhupalhe u Nayoashi, ntu o Uebiezeri. Nagidioni anaaya Nayoashi ayo, ari eepettaka ingaano munlhikitini mwo waamelha izabibu wiira ahooniye ni attu o Umidiani. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Nnepa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkawaakhumelhelha, nkaweerelha wiira, “Apwiiya Nlhuku ari vamoka ni inyuva, inyu o wooria waatakana ikhoto va.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Nagidioni nkayaakhulha wo wiira, “Inyu Athithi aka, yakhalhaka Apwiiya Nlhuku ari vamoka ni hii, woonaka chittu chonkhaye chilha chihonipatta? Chiri vayi mitheko chaya cho ushangiha chaanihimeria aya manyaashulhupalhe ihu, yeeraka wiira, ‘Apwiiya Nlhuku phi nikuminhe wiilhaponi Umisri.’ Nansho vano Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoniriha ni unihelha mmiononi mwa attu o Umidiani!”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaarukunuwelha ni weerelha wiira, “Nrweeke wo ikuru irina inyu, mwookolhe attu o Uisraeli ukhuma wa attu o Umidiani. Phi mii kinourumani.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Nagidioni nkayaakulha yiiraka, “Paahi Thithi, kinohalha wooria chani wookholha attu o Uisraeli? Nihimo naka phi nihimo no uhuperiacha upwaha mahimo onkhaye o nikosho ni Namanase, ni mi kimwanene phi mwankani chinene umbumbani wihu uwo!”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Ni Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhulha wo wiira, “Kinowoorihani, ni inyu nnowaarimeelhiha attu o Umidiani thoko nnonrimeelhiha ntu mmoka.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Nagidioni nkayaakhulha, “Paahi yakhalhaka kihopata nipesha uwaninyu, nkooniheke etu ithikineha kichuwelheke wiira wo ikekhiaye phi inyu nnoolhumacha ni mii. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Ni vavawo chonte nhithame etu vaa, mpaka vanohalha aka uhokolhia ni uwiiherani isadaka aka yo yolhia ni weesha umihoolho winyu vawo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">Ni ayo nkayaakhulha yeeraka, “Kinookhalha vava mpaka vanohalha inyu uhokolhia.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Paahi Nagidioni nkayaarwa uwannyaya, nkaamwaapia mwaapuri ni mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure ukhuma isaado yo ipepa, nkayaahelha inama iyo muutingoni, ni nhuchi nnyoopweni, Yamalheke nkaarwehelha waari mwiri wo mwaaloni, nkayaavaha. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Nnepa wa Nlhuku nkaweera, “Nkusheke inama ni mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure mweesheke vachulhu mwalha ulha. Mwamalhihaka, nhelheke nhuchi vachulhu wo mikatte ni inama.” Ni ayo nkayaapanga chiicho. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Nnepa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ahookolha ikopo awe, nkaakwakwanya inama ni mikatte wo ikopo iyo. Wo uhikhulhuvelhiya, mooro wahopharelha vamwalhani vawo, nkawaapaha inama ni mikatte chilhe. Phiyaru, nnepa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ahothama umihoolho waya.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Phi vavawo Nagidioni vaachuwenlhe aya wiira yoyo ari nnepa a Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkeera, “Maanyi, kimpani mii! Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya kihomwoona nnepa inyu ikhove wo ikhove.”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku nkeera wiira, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu. Nhoove khannokhwa.”<verse eid="JDG 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Paahi Nagidioni nkayaathekelha Apwiiya Nlhuku madhubahu wowo ni wiihana, “Apwiiya Nlhuku phi nowiha mpuha.” Eiyo, yayo madhubahu ayo arii wowo Uofra uwo, iwani ya Abiezeri, mpaka nna.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nagidioni anoophomolha madhubahu a Baali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Yoyo uhiyu uyo Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nagidioni wiira, “Nkusheke n'dume no ing'ope wa athumwaninyu, n'dume ni nayelhi no iyaakha saba. Mphomolheke madhubahu a Baali arinaya athumwaninyu ni wuunthakacha isinyago ya Ashera irii vakhiviru ni madhubahu ayo. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Mwamalhihaka, nkithekelheke madhubahu mii Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, vakittu voombone vachulhu mwaamwako va. Mwamalaka nkikumiereke isadaka yo upahiya yo mwaan'dume ulhe wo ikhuni cho isinyago ya Ashera ilhe.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Paahi Nagidioni ahaakusha anamitheko aya khumi, nkayaapanga thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. Nansho ukhalhawaya ari oovaka ashilhoko a athumwanaya, ni attu o vawani vawo, baada yo uphanga yayo uthana, aapannge uhiyu.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Attu o ilhapo iyo vonkwilhe aya wichishuru, ahoona madhubahu a Baali ni isinyago ya Ashera yaari vakhiviru aya, chinatupulhiye, ni ing'ope yo nayelhi inakumihiye isadaka yo upahiya vachulhu wo yayo madhubahu ikooroshiye ayo. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Attu nkayaakohanacha, “Mpani pannge yelha ittu ilha?” Vaathempe aya ukoherera nkayaachuwelhacha wiira ari Nagidioni anaaya Nayoashi phi pannge yayo. <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Paahi attu o ilhapo iyo ahorwaa u Nayoashi, nkayeerelha wiira, “Munkumihe mwaamwaninyu nimwiive, ukhalhawaya hotanganya madhubahu a Baali ni wunthakacha isinyago ya Ashera yaari vakhiviru ni madhubahu ayo.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Paahi Nayoashi nkayaakhulha attu onkhaye aawilhe ayo wo wiira, “Chani nnomwaakiha Baali? Chani nnoomwokholha? Ntu riyoothe paahi nomwaakiha norimelhihiya uhinaya usha. Yakhalhaka Baali phi Nlhuku o ikekhiaye, paahi etu eechakiheke mwanene, ukhalhawaya madhubahu awe ahophomolhiya ni Nagidioni.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Paahi Nagidioni aheehaniya nenno nihuku nno nkayeehaniya “Yeru Baali” maana aya, “Baali eechakiheke umihoolho wawe.” ukhalhawaya ahophomolha madhubahu a Baali.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Yeyo ikatema iyo attu o Umidiani attu o Uamaleki ni attu akina o wowo unosha nchuwa ni mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani aheeshacha mapuro aya unikoteni Nayezreeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Nansho Iphumu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaaholhelha Nagidioni. Ni ayo nkayoopa nipalhapatta weehana Abiezeri awaache yaatware. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Yamalheke nkayaaruma akarumiya mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye mwa ashinna Manase awe yaatwara. Akarumiya akina nkaarumiya arwee eehane attu o makosho a Asheri, Zebuloni ni Naftali, ni ayo nkayaawa ukumaana ni ayo.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Nagidioni nkaamwirelha Nlhuku wiira, “Yakhalhaka nowoopolha attu o Uisraeli wo moono aka thoko chihimilhe inyu, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />vano kinoweesha nrapalha no ikhondoro vammutoni vaneepettelhiya ingaano. Ukame watapwihaka nrapalha nno etu, ni mmuto uyo wo uhitapwa, paahi kinochuwelha wiira nnowookholha attu o Uisraeli wo moono aka thoko chihimilhe inyu.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Nkayaakhalha thoko chiicho, ukhalhawaya vonkwilhe aya wichishuru ahaama ukame waari vachulhu nenno nrapalha nno, nkaachariha nnyoopweni. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Yamalheke Nagidioni nkaamwirelha Nlhuku wiira, “Chonte nhikithunalhelhe. Kinoulhepelhani wiira kuulhumache vakani tho. Ninouvendani nkihiyerereke kitumiye nrapalha nna, kilhikache ittu ikina. Ninouvendani wiira ukame wo vachulhu nrapalha uyo wuumeke, nansho uri vammutoni vawo ukhalheke ukame.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Nlhuku nkaapanga chiichammo yoyo uhiyu uyo, ukhalhawaya, vachulhu nrapalha vaari vanoomilhe, ni vammutoni vaari vanatampwe ukame.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Nagidioni anowaakottolha attu o Umidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Nihuku nimoka Nagidioni ni attu onkhaye aarina aya vamoka ahonkwacha wichishuru, nkayeesha nipuro naya unikoteni vakhiviru nrapo no Uarodi. Nipuro na attu o Umidiani naari uchulhu waya, unikoteni vakhiviru mwaako wo Umore.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nagidioni wiira, “Attu aarina inyu phi enchi chinene uwannyaka mii, wo waakottolha attu o Umidiani. Paahi attu o Uisraeli ahiwe yeefuna umihoolho waka, ni uhimia wiira eechoponlhe wo machiri aya ashinene. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Vano etu, nkhuwelhacheke wa attu onkhaye wiira, ntu riyothe o woova, ama notetemelha ahokolhieke uwannyawe, ni hii ninookhalha vava vamwaakoni Ugileadi va.” Paahi Nagidioni ahaalhika attu, ni attu maelufu makhumi melhi ni maelufu melhi ahokholhia uwani, nkayaahalha ni attu maelufu khumi.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nagidioni, “Yayo attu ayo arii enchi chinene. Vano mwaarweheke umaraponi ni mii kinokowaalhikacha wowo. Ntu riyoothe nohalha aka ulhelhani wiira, ‘Ulha munttukaneke, yoyo munttukaneke. Nansho ntu riyoothe kinouhimeriakani wiira nhinttukane, yoyo nhittukane.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Paahi Nagidioni nkayanrweeha attu umaraponi ni Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha wiira, “Mwaamwalhaniheke attu anolhatha maashi thoko mwalhapwa, ni alhe anokhoromacha vanowuria aya maashi wo mathatha.”<verse eid="JDG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Attu aawunrie maashi wo urika ni miono chaya ni ulhatha thoko mwalhapwa ari attu imia ttaru. Nansho akina onkhaye aahanlhe ayo ahokhoroma uwuria maashi. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nagidioni wiira, “Wo yayo attu imia ttaru awunrie maashi wo ulhatha thoko mwalhapwa ayo, kinowoopolha attu o Uisraeli ni waakottolha attu o Umidiani. Nansho akina onkhaye alhe ahohokolhiacheke umanupani waya.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Paahi Nagidioni nkayaakusha choolhia cha alhe oopa mapalhapata alhe, nkayaalheha wiira arwaacheke umanupani waya. Yayo nkaahalha ni attu imia ttaru alhe, ni nipuro na attu o Umidiani naari unikoteni mpata waya wo vathi.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Yoyo uhiyu uyo Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nagidioni wiira, “Nrwee mwaakelhelhe unipuroni waya, ukhalhawaya kihomalha waakottolha. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Nansho yakalha nnowova nrwee vamoka ni akarumia inyu Pura. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Wowo nnowiiwa chinohimia aya, ni inyu anoopatta machiri o wooria urwaa waakelhelha.” Paahi Nagidioni ahorwaa vamoka ni karumiya aya Pura mpaka varii nipuro na attu o ulhitelhelha mapuro a attu o Umidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Attu o Umidiani, ni attu o Uamaleki ni attu onkhaye o mpata uneelha nchuwa ahorupacha unikoteni, ari attu enchi thoko nashombe, ni ingamiya chaya chihinaalhakelhia, yaani enchi thoko nhaava wo umbwaani.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Nagidioni vaaphilhe aya wowo, ahomwiiwa ntu mmoka ahimiacheraka ashikhunanawe itora yaalhohilhe awe, eeraka, “Kiholhoha wiira, nkatte wo ishayiri waari uphirikiaka mpaka unipuroni wa attu o Umidiani, nkawaaphitha nihema ni upitikusha mpitinkolhe, nkanaawulhuwa vathi.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Nkhunanawe uyo nkaamwakhulha, “Yeyo inooniha etu uphanga wa ulhe ntu o Uisraeli Gidioni mwaana a Nayoashi ulhe, vahiye machiri ni Nlhuku o waakottolha attu o Umidiani vamoka ni mphingo aya wonkhaye.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Nagidioni veewilhe aya ulhamulhiya wo itora iyo ni maana aya, ahonthimicha Nlhuku. Yamalheke ahohokolhia unipuroni wa attu o Uisraeli, nkayeerelha attu wiira, “Munkweke nngwee, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahomalha ukottolha mphingo wa attu o Umidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Paahi ahaamianiha attu imia ttaru alhe mikutiro miraru, nkaavaha mapalhapata ni inyipo cho mithuko. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Nkayeerelha wiira, “Nkiweheke ni uphanga thoko chinohalha aka uphanga ikatema vanohalha aka watameria uphiya unipuroni. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Mii vamoka ni nkutiro aka, vanohalha ihu woopa mapalhapata, ni inyu mwaatti onkhaye mwoopeke mapalhapata ukhuma kila mpata ni ukhuwelha wiira, ‘Wo nlhatu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ni wo nlhatu u Nagidioni!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Vaatamenrie aya uhiyu iriyari, Nagidioni ni nkutiro aya wa attu imia imoka, ahaatameria nipuro na amalhaponi aya ayo. Yeyo yaari baada etu yo uphiya mwisho wo nipuro, vanochokholha izamu yo veriyari, ikatema vaari aya avirihanaka izamu. Paahi nkayoopacha mapalhapata ni upweshakacha inyipo chaari aya ayo. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Mikutiro chonkhaye miraru vamoka, chahoopacha mapalhapata ni upweshakacha inyipo chaya cho mithuko. Mmiononi mwaya, wiimushi ari anakunshe mithuko, ni wiimonono anakunshe mapalhapata yoopaka uno akhuwelhachaka yeeraka, “Uphanga wo nlhatu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ni wo nlhatu u Nagidioni!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Kila mmoka nkeemelha vakittu wawe urukurieria nipuro, mphingo wonkhaye wa amalhaponi nkawaamwaria uno ukhuwelhachaka. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Paahi attu a Nagidioni voopa aya mapalhapata aya imia ttaru, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaapanga attu o Umidiani achokholhe wiivana ashineneru unipuroni waya uwo. Aahanlhe ayo nkaattawacha mpaka Userera vanorwaa Ubeth Shita, mpaka mwiinano wo Uabeli Mehla vakhiviru ni Utabathi.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Manyaalhopwana o ilhapo yo Uisraeli ahokumaana ukhuma Unaftali, Uasheri ni Umanase, onkhaye aheehanachiya nkayaatwarelhelha attu o Umidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Yamalheke Nagidioni ahaaruma attu kila ilhapo yo miako cho Efraimu ahimiache wiira, “Nkhuruwacheke naate attu o Umidiani ni waatiyelhelha, wo uvara mateeka mathapwi ni mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani mpaka Ubethbara.” Paahi ashilhopwana onkhaye o Efraimu nkayaawa uvara mwolhoko wo Uyorodani mpaka Ubethbara. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Nkayaakusha ashulhupalhe eelhi a attu o Umidiani, yaani Orebu ni Zeebu, mateeka. Nkaamwiiva Orebu umwaalhani Uhorebu, ni Zeebu nkayaamwiiva waamelhiya idivai wa Zeebu, vaatwarelhelha aya Amildiani. Nkayaawiihera Nagidioni miuru cha Orebu ni Zeebu, ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Attu o Umidiani anookottolhiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Paahi attu o Efraimu nkayeerelha Nagidioni wiira, “Nnipangenlhe chiicho wo nlhatu waani? Chani woonaka khannihanne vaarwelhe inyu waatakana ikhoto ni attu o Umidiani?” Nkayaachukulhacha chinene.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Nansho Nagidioni nkayaakhulha yiiraka wiira, “Ittu kipangilhe aka mii kihii ittu mena, thoko chinolhikanihiya aya ni alhe mpannge inyu mwaatti. Ilhokotilhe aya attu a Naefraimu vanlhalhani, phi ittu yoombone upwaha ipattilhe aya ashilhoko aka attu o nlhoko u Naabiezeri. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Nlhuku hookottolhelhani aholhelhi o Umidiani, Orebu ni Zeebu. Chani ittu yaani kipannge aka mii, nkakaalhikanihiya ni inyu mwaatti?” Nagidioni vaamalhinhe aya uhimia chiicho, urushiya wa attu u Nagidioni, wahotondova.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Paahi Nagidioni ni ashikhunanaya imia ttaru nkayaaphiyacha umwoolhokoni Uyorodani, nkayalhapuwacha. Inakhalhaka ari anoochelhe chinene, ahorwaacha ni waattwara amalhaponi aya. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Paahi nkayeerelha attu o Usukothi wiira, “Chonte mwaavaheke ashikhunanaka alha mikatte, ukhalhawaya ahoochacha chinene, ni mii kinoothepa waattwara mamwene Zeba ni Salmuna o Umidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Nansho aholhelhi o Usukothi ahokoha, “Nuuvahekeni mikatte cho ishiyani, ni inyu khannaakottolha Zeba ni Salmuna?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Paahi Nagidioni nkeera, “Eiyo, nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku vanohalha aya waakottolha Zeba ni Salmuna, kinoowa kaakhavakacha iruttu chinyu wo mwiiwa ni mirooka cho uthakhwani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Ukhuma wowo nkayaarwelha attu o Upenueli, nkayaavekelha chiichammo. Ni ayo attu o Upenueli nkayaakulha thoko yaakhunlhe aya attu o Usukothi. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Nagidioni nkeera, “Vanohalha aka uhokolhia wo mpuha kinoophomolhacha ilha ishanja ilha.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Paahi yayo ashi Zeba ni Salmuna ayo ari wowo Ukarkori uwo, vamoka ni mphingo aya wa attu maelufu khumi ni nthanu yaahanlhe ukhuma mphingo waakhumme unosha nchuwa, maana ashikhunanaya ilaki imoka ni makhumi meelhi ahevakachiya. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Paahi Nagidioni nkayaatwara iphiro yo mpata uneelha nchuwa, irii unoshelha nchuwa Unoba ni Uyogbeha iphiro ya attu o maronda, nkayaakelhelha mphingo waari uneeshiukilhe uyo. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Mamwene o Umidiani, Zeba ni Salmuna nkayaattawacha, nansho Nagidioni nkayaattwara, nkayaavaracha ni woopopiha chinene mphingo wonkhaye.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Yamalheke, Nagidioni, anaaya Nayoashi, ahohokolhia ukhuma ukhotoni aviraka iphiro inokhuruwelha mphitho wo Uheresi, <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />nkayammara mmirawo mmoka o Usukothi uwo ni unkohakoha. Yoyo mmirawo uyo, nkaaromolhacha machina a manyaashulhupalhe o uchuwania o Usukothi, ni ijumla aya yaari attu makhumi saba ni saba. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Ni yamalhekeru, Nagidioni ahohokolhia wa attu o Usukothi alhe, nkayeerelhacha wiira, “Chani, nnowuupuwelha ngati chenre inyu wo ukiruwana venre inyu, ‘Nlhatu waani naavahe mikatte attu inyu oochanche chinene, ni inyuva khannoria waakottolha Zeba ni Salmuna?’ Haya etu, Zeba ni Salmuna phi alha va.”<verse eid="JDG 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Paahi nkayaakusha ashulhupalhe o Usukothi ni weettuchiha manyaalhopwana onkhaye o usukothi waakhavakacha iruttu chaya wo mwiiwa ni mirooka. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Nkayaaphomolhacha ishanja yo Upenueli ni weevakacha attu o yeyo ilhapo iyo.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Yamalheke, nkayaakohacha Zeba ni Salmuna wiira, “Attu mweevilhe inyu wowo Utabori alhe, ari chani?” Nkayaakulhacha yiiraka, “Aalhikanne ni inyuva, ukhalhawaya kila mmoka oonia thoko achishana a amwene.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Ni ayo nkeerelha wiira, “Yayo yaari ashilhoko aka, achishana a anumwanaka o ukiyara. Kinolhupelha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku arii akumi, nhikeevilhe, ata mii akoowiivani.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Yamalheke nkaamwiirelha Yetheri, mwaamwanaya o nttara, “Weemelheke weeveke alha.” Nansho Yetheri ahoova ukusha uphanga awe uyo, ukalhawaya ari baado mwammirawo.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Vavawo Zebu ni Salmuna nkayeerelha Nagidioni wiira, “Nniiveke inyuva mwanene, ukhalhawaya ulha phi ntheko wa ntu muulhupalhe.” Nagidioni nkayeevekacha anene ni ukusha mapambo ari nshikoni mwo ingamiya chaya.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Yamalheke yayo, attu o Uisraeli nkayeerelha Nagidioni wiira, “Inyuva etu nkhalheke phi nholhelhi ihu, ni baada yo inyu aniholhelheke achishana inyu, ukhalhawaya inyuva nhonoopolha ukhuma wa attu o Umidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Nagidioni nkaakhulhacha wo wiira, “Mii kinokhalha nholhelhi inyu, mena mwaamwanaka khanokhalha nholhelhi inyu. Apwiiya Nlhuku phi nohalha ukhalha nholhelhi inyu.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Yamalheke nkeerelha wiira, “Kinothanana uvekelhani ittu imoka, kinothanana kila mmoka inyu akivaheke ivipuli chivanre inyu mateeka.” Ukhalhawaya attu o Umidiani alhe thoko chiri aya attu akina o uthakoni, ari anawaranche ivipuli cho idhahabu.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Attu nkayaakhulha, “Ninouvahani wo nrima ihu.” Nkayaathalhacha ikuwo ni kila mmoka nkeesha mwommo ivipuli cho idhahabu chaavanre awe mateeka. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Ivipuli chaapochenre aya Nagidioni, ulhemelha waya chonkhaye waari ikilo makhumi meelhi. Uthepa cho chechiyo, ahopochera tho ni ivipuli, ikuwo cho zambarau chaawariye ni amwene a attu o Umidiani ni mikufu chaari nshikoni mwo ingamiya chaya. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Paahi Gidioni nkayaakoroshelha isinyago yeeshilhe aya iwani yo Uofra. Attu o Uisraeli onkhaye nkayaarwacha wowo uthimichani. Isinyago iyo nkayaakhalha nriankho wa Nagidioni ni ashilhoko aya.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Paahi attu o Umidiani ahokottolhiya ni attu o Uisraeli, mpuha nkayaakhalha wo ikatema yo iyaakha makhumi ncheshe, wo uhoopopihiya ni attu o Umidiani.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Urimeelha u Nagidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Yamalheke Nagidioni yaani Nayeru Baali, anaaya Nayoashi ahohokolhia uwannyaya ni ukhalha wowo. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Nagidioni yaari ni achishana ashilhopwana khumi ni saba, ukhalhawaya ari ni mavasha a manyaathiyana enchi. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Ahokhalha ni namitheko nthiyana wowo Ushekemu uwo annyarinhe aya mwaana mwanlhopwana, nchina nawe eehaniye Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Paahi Nagidioni anaaya Nayoashi, ahorimeelha anari ni malhipa o iyaakha chinchi, nkaavithiya mahiye a Uyoashi athumwanaya, wi ilhapo yo Uofra, Ubiezeri.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Yamalheke, baada yo urimeelha u Nagidioni, attu o Uisraeli ahohokolhelha ni uthimicha milhuku chaya cho Baali. Nkayampanga Baali Berithi ukhalha phi nlhuku aya. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Aisraeli nkayaalhiyalha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku aya, athaminhe ukhuma wa amalhaponi aya enchi anrukurenrie aya kila mpata. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Tho, khaapangenlhe ittu yo ulhoka ashilhoko a Nayeru Baali yaani Nagidioni, wo chittu choombone chonkhaye chaapangilhe aya Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Naabimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Naabimeleki anaaya Nagidioni, ahorwaa iwani yo Ushekemu, waakhalhacha aya ashilhoko ni achishana onkhaye o nikosho na anumwanaya. Nkayeerelha wiira, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Nkihimerieke vava, umihoolho wa attu o Ushekemu. Ittu yaani irii yoombone uwaninyu, wiira achishana onkhaye khumi ni saba ashilhopwanaru a Nayeru Baali otawareni ama mwaana mmoka? Muupuwelheke wiira mii phi iphome inyu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Ashilhoko a anumwanaya alhe nkayaavira ahimiachaka malhove onkhaye alha wo nlhatu waya, ni attu onkhaye o Ushekemu nkayaattwara ukhalhawaya ari nlhoko aya. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Nkayaavaha ikipande makhumi saba cho isiliva chaari unupani wa nlhuku Baali Berithi, wiira aavahe aya attu o uhikhalhe ni irusho ni attu o unanrokotolhe wiira aatware. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Nkayaattukanacha urwaa wa athumwanaya, Uofra, ni wowo nkayeevakacha ashilhoko aya onkhaye makhumi saba, vachulhu nlhuku nimoka. Nansho Yothamu, mwaamwana mwankani a Nayerubabeli ahokulhuphuwa, kheeviye, ari neevinthe. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Yamalheke, anenchi o ilhapo yonkhaye yo Ushekemu ni o Ubeth Umilo ahokumaana vaari mwiri muulhupalhe vakhiviru ni ishanja wowo Ushekemu uwo, nkayaavara nchina Naabimeleki ukhalha amwene aya.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Nayothamu veewilhe awe yoyo mwaha uyo, ahorwaa ni weemelha vamwaakoni Ugerizimu, nkaakhuwelha wo wiira, nkakiiweni, inyu mwaatti attu o Ushekemu, mwathananaka Nlhuku owiiwelhelheni ni inyuva. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Nihuku nimoka khalhai, miri chahothukumana vamoka wiira chinthanlhe mwene aya. Paahi miri nkacheerelha mwiri wo nzeituni wiira, nnitawareke. <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Nansho mwiri wo nzeituni nkawaakhulha, nnaanyihera wiira, kinowooria uhiya ntheko aka wo uyariha makhura anothimichiya chinene ni milhuku ni attu, wiira kirwe keehuvihe utawara miri. <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Yamalheke miri nkacheerelha mwiri wo ntini, nkawaani inyuva nnitawareke.<verse eid="JDG 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Nansho mwiri wo ntini nkawaakhulha, chani nnaanyihera wiira kinoohiya ntheko wo uyara maphepu orera ni oochiva, kirwe keehuvihe utawara miri. <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Yamalheke miri nkacheerelha mwiri wo nzabibu, nkawaani inyuva nkhalheke nholhelhi ihu? <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Nansho nzabibu nkawaakulha wiiraka, Chani nnaanyihera wiira kinoohiya ntheko aka yo uyariha idivai inaachivelha milhuku ni attu, kirwe keehuvihe uholhelha miri? <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Wo umalhelha, miri chonkhaye nkachaarwaa ni wiirelha mwiri wo mwiiwa wiira, paahi mmweeke inyuva nnihoolhelhe. <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Mwiri wo mwiiwa nkawaakulha wiiraka, wo ikekhiaye mwathananaka ukithanlha ukhalha amwene, mmweeke etu nkhalheke vanttuchini waka. Nansho mwaahittuneke uphanga chiicho, paahi mooro uthameke mmiiwani waka ni upaha ata mierezi cho Lebanoni.<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Nayothamu nkayaathepa uhimiacha wiira, “Vano paahi, chani nnoona wiira nhaavara nchina Naabimeleki wo nrima woombone ni wo ukhulhuvelhiya? Chani nnaanyihera wiira nhaapangelha ittu yoombone Nayeru Baali ni ashilhoko aya thoko chaathananiya wo ntheko aya? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Muupuwelheke wiira athumwanaka aheehelha ntatakoni ukumi aya, wo waatakanelha ni wookholha ukhuma wa attu o Umidiani! <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Nansho lhelho va nhaarukunuwa ashilhoko a athumwanaka, nkamweevakacha achishana aya makhumi saba vachulhu nlhuku nimoka. Yamalheke mwahaapanga Naabimeleki, mwaana a namitheko a athumwana aka, akhalhe mwene a attu o ilhapo yo Ushekemu, ukhalhawaya yoyo ntu uyo o nikosho ninyu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Paahi vano, yakhalhaka mpannge yayo wo nrima woombone ni wo waathimicha Nayeru Baali ni achishana aya paahi, nttapelhelheke vamoka ni Naabimeleki, ni ayo attapelhelheke vamoka ni inyu. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Nansho yaahikhalheke chiichammo, mooro ukhumeke wa Naabimeleki ni waarimelhiha attu o ilhapo yo Ushekemu ni o Ubeth Umilo, tho mooro ukhumeke wa attu o ilhapo yo Ushekemu ni Ubethmilo ni waarimeelhiha Naabimeleki.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Yamalheke Nayothamu ahotoroka, nkayaattawelha Ubeeri, nkayaakhalha wowo, ukhalhawaya ahoova Naabimeleki ahima aya. Nkayaakalha wowo.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Naabimeleki ahaatawara attu o Uisraeli iyaakha taaru. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Yamalheke Nlhuku nkaawiha nrima wo uhilhoka variyari wa Naabimeleki ni attu o Ushekemu, ni ayo nkayaakhotiya. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Phi chiichammo chaatwarushiye aya attu o Ushekemu vamoka ni nlhoko aya Naabimeleki, wo ushilhilhi waapangenlhe aya achishana makhumi saba a Nayeru Baali. Ntwarusho no yoyo nookhwa uyo waapantte ukhalhawaya Naabimeleki yeevilhe yayo wo ukavihiya ni attu o Ushekemu ayo. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Paahi attu o ilhapo yo Ushekemu yaheesha attu vachulhu mwaako wiira aathurulhe mihakhu attu onkhaye aavira wowo. Naabimaleki nkayaahimeriya yoyo mwaha uyo.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Nihuku nimoka Nagaali, anaaya Naebedi, vamoka ni ashilhoko aya ahorwaa ukhalhani Ushekemu. Attu o ilhapo ya Ushekemu nkayaakhalha ni nrima wo waarumelhelha. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Nkayaakhumacha ni urwaa waari imata chaya cho mizabibu, ni urukulhacha izabibu, nkayaamakacha ni ukoorosha idivai ni uphanga isikukuu. Nkayaakelha unupani wa nlhuku aya nkayaalhia ni uwuria, Yamalheke nkayaaruwana Naabimaleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Nagaali anaaya Naebedi, nkeera wiira, “Naabimaleki phi mapani? Hiyaano attu o Ushekemu va, phi attu ni ata naathimiche Naabimaleki? Nagidioni ni Nazebuli, namitheko aya nholhelhi, haathimicha Nahamori athumwanaya Nashekemu, nansho nlhatu waani naathimiche Naabimaleki? Nansho vano mwaakavihereke ashulhupalhe inyu o Uhamori. <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Nansho yakaari alha attu alha aarii phi attu kinaatawara aka, kaanathamiha Naabimaleki. Kaaneerelha Naabimaleki wiira, ‘Muncherereke mphingo inyu wa manyaasikaari, mwamalhaka mmweeke naatakana voonene.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Paahi Nazebuli nholhelhi o iwani, yeeweke malhove anoolhumacha aya Nagaali anaaya Naebedi, ahorushiya chinene. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Paahi nkayaarwehelha nttenga Naabimaleki Utorma uwo, nkayeerelha wiira, “Nagaali, mwaana a Naebedi, vamoka ni ashilhoko aya, ahokelhacha vawani Ushekemu ni uthotheria wiira attu o ukhoteni inyuva. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Paahi nhokolhieke inyuva ni attu nrina inyu ayo, ikatema yo uhiyu, mweethelheke umatani vakhiviru ni vawani. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Nchuwa vanokhuma aya wichishu, nkelhelheke iwani iyo. Nagaali akhumaka vamoka ni attu aya uwa waatakana ni inyu, mwaapangelheke chinothananiya aya.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Paahi Naabimaleki ahothama nkayaarwaa ni attu aarina aya vamoka ni umaka Ushekemu ikatema yo uhiyu. Nkaamianiha attu aya mikutiro micheshe wiithelha wowo vakhiviru ni vawani. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Nagaali, mwaana a Naebedi, nkaakhuma vathe ni weemelha urii nlhako wo ukelhea vawani, yoyo ikatema iyo Naabimeleki ni attu aya ahokhuma vakittu veevinthe aya. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Paahi Nagaali voonilhe aya nkayeerelha Nazebuli wiira, “Mmweheke, attu anookhuruwacha ukhuma uchulhu mwaako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Nazebuli nkayaakhulha, “Inyuva nnoona irungwi cho miako, thoko attu.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Yamalheke Nagaali nkeera, “Mmweheke! Attu anookhuruwa variyari ilhapo ni nkutiro nkina unokumelhelha mpata o mwiri mulhupalhe wa attu o moopa nttiti.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Yamalheke Nazebuli nkayaakhulha, “Wiifuna winyu urii vayi vano? Phi inyuva ngati mwenre wiira, ‘Naabimaleki phi mapani? Naathimicheke wo nlhatu waani?’ Vano yayo phi attu mwaaheulhanche inyu, nrweeke etu Mwaatakaneke.” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Paahi Nagaali ahokhuma aholhelhihaka attu o Ushekemu ni waatakana ni Naabimaleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Nansho Nagaali ahoochelha ni uttawa, uno atoporanihiyaka ni Naabimaleki. Attu enchi ahorakhalhihiya ni ukhwaacha mphironi mpaka vanlhako muulhupalhe wo ukelha vawani. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Naabimaleki nkayaakhalha Uaruma ni Nazebuli nkayoomolha Nagaali ni ashilhoko aya wiira akhume ilhapo yo Ushekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Waashelhe waya, Naabimaleki aheewa wiira attu o ilhapo o Ushekemu ahookhumacha vawani ni urwaa mmamatani. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Nkayaakusha attu aya nkayamianiha mikutiro micheshe, wiira arwaache eethelhe umamatani. Voonilhe aya attu anokhuma vawani, ahokhuma veevithilhe aya nkayeevakacha. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Naabimeleki ni nkutiro waya nkayaarwacha attimakachaka, urwaa ulhitelhelha nlhako wo ukelha vawani. Mikutiro chaya miilhi chikina nkachaatakacha attu ari umamatani alhe ni weevakacha. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Naabimaleki nkayaatakana ni attu o iwani iyo nihuku nonkhaye. Yamalheke, nkayaavara mateeka ilhapo iyo ni weeva attu onkhaye aarii vawani vawo. Nkayaarimeelhiha yeyo ilhapo iyo wo mooro ni uhelha maakha.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Yamalheke attu onkhaye yaari waari ingome yo Ushekemu vewiilhe aya yoyo mwaha uyo, ahottawelha urii nipuro no inupa ya nlhuku eehaniye El Berithi. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Naabimaleki nkayaahimeriya wiira attu onkhaye yaari ingome yo Ushekemu yahothukumana vamoka. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Paahi Naabimaleki ni attu awe ahorwaa umwaakoni Usalmoni, nkayaakusha ipacho nkayaatupulha nritta no mwiri ni weesha vanikhathani waya. Yamalheke, nkayeerelha attu attukanne aya ayo wiira yaakuviheke uphanga thoko chipannge aya. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Kila mmoka nkaatupulha nritta thoko nenne ni Naabimaleki nne. Nkayaakushacha maritta ayo ni weemesha urii ishiri yo mwiinano, nkayaapaha mooro ni upaha ingome. Attu onkhaye manyaalhopwana ni manyaathiyana aaphiya elufu imoka, yaari wi ingome yo Ushekemu ahokhwaacha.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Yamalheke Naabimaleki nkayarwaa Uthebesi, nkayaarukureria iwani iyo ni uvara mateeka. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Nansho yahokhalha ishanja yo machiri variyari iwani vawo. Paahi attu onkhaye o ilhapo iyo manyaalhopwana ni manyaathiyana ahottawelha wowo ni wiitelha mpaani. Nkayaawelha vachulhu nchaara no ishanja iyo. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Naabimaleki nkayaaphiyelha ishanja iyo ni ukelhelha. Yamalheke ahaatameria nlhako wo ishanja iyo, wiira apahe mooro. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />Ni nthiyana mmoka ari vachulhu ishanja iyo, ahowonya nlhuku no ushilhelha no vachulhu nkanaanyatha Naabimeleki vamuruni. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Yamalheke Naabimaleki ahomwiihana mmirawo aya aakushilhe ikerero chaya aakuvie ni umwiirelha wiira, “Ukusheke uphanga awo, ukiiveke, ahiwe attu aahimia wiira kiheeviya ni nthiyana.” Mmirawo uyo ahokusha uphanga awe, nkaahoma Naabimeleki ni weeva. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Attu o Uisraeli voonilhe aya wiira Naabimaleki ahorimeelha, ahothamacha ni uhokolhia kila mmoka uwannyawe.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Paahi phi chiichammo etu, Nlhuku chaahokolhoshenre aya Naabimaleki wo nlhatu waya waapannge aya wa athumwanaya wo weevakacha ashilhoko aya makhumi saba. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Tho, chiicho Nlhuku ahaatwarusha attu o Ushekemu wo nlhatu no uwonya waapangilhe aya. Paahi etu, malhavo a Nayothamu mwaana a Nayeru Baali ahaapatta.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Natola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Arimeelheke Naabimeleki, Natola anaaya Napua, anaaya Nadodo o nikosho ni Naisakari, ahokhalha phi nholhelhi o woopolha attu o Uisraeli. ayo Natola ayo aakhalha Ushamiri ilhapo yo umiakoni yo Efraimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Yayo ari ntu o waamulha milhatu attu o Uisraeli wo iyaakha makhumi meelhi ni taaru, Yamalheke ahorimeelha ni uvithiya wowo Ushamiri uwo.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Nayairi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Arimeelheke Natola, ahokhalha Nayairi o Ugileadi, nkaaholhelha attu o Uisraeli wo iyaakha makhumi meelhi ni piilhi. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Nayairi arii ni achishana ashilhopwana makhumi mararu, eetakacha anaweenlhe iphuta makhumi mararu. Yayo iwani chaya chaari makhumi mararu wiilhaponi Ugileadi, uneehaniya mpaka lhelho nna Howoth Yairi. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Nayairi ahorimeelha ni uvithiya Ukamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Nayefta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Yamalheke, attu o Uisraeli ahowonya tho umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaathimicha Mabaali, Maashtarothi, ni milhuku cho Usiria, cho Usidoni, Umoabu, Uamoni ni wa Ufilisti. Ahaahiya Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni uhaathimicha tho. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaarushiya chinene vonne aya chittu chaapannge aya attu o Uisraeli, ni ayo nkaahiya wiira akottolhiye ni Afilisti ni attu o Uamoni. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Yayo ni ayo ahaatwarusha ni waamereriha attu o Uisraeli iyaakha khumi ni nane, attu o Uisraeli aakhanlhe Ugileadi, ilhapo ya attu o Uamori, mpata unosha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani uwo. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Attu o ilhapo yo Uamoni ni ayo aholhapuwacha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni urwaa waatakana ni attu o makosho a Nayuda, ni Nabenyamini ni Naefraimu. Nkaathepiha attu o Uisraeli uthemwa chinene.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli aholhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, yeeraka wiira, “Nihoowonyani inyuva, ukhalhawaya nihouhiyani inyu Nlhuku ihu, ni waathimicha Mabaali.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Ni Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhulha wo wiira, “Chani mii akuthaminheni ukhuma wa attu o Umisri, nkakowopolhani wa attu o Uamoni, wa Aamori ni wa Afilisti, <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />attu o Usidoni, attu o Uamaleki ni attu o Umidiani otwarushani. Ni inyuva nkamwaakunlhelha, ni mii nkakowoopolhani ukhuma mmiononi mwaya? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Inakhalhaka ahopanga chiicho, mwaattiva ahokihiya, nkamwaathimicha milhuku chikina. Paahi akinowookholhani tho. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Nrwaacheke mwonlhelheke etu chechiyo milhuku chithanlhe inyu chiyo. Nhiyeke chechiyo chiwe chowaakihani untwarushoni winyu uwo!”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Nansho attu o Uisraeli nkayeerelha Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira, “Nihowonya, nnipangeke chinothanana inyu, nansho ninouvendani wiira nnookholhe lhelho.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Yamalheke ahorihelha utayi milhuku chilheto chiyo, nkayaathimicha tho Apwiiya Nlhuku. Apwiiya Nlhuku khayoonrie uvilhelha chinene woona ntwarusho wa attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Yeyo ikatema iyo attu o Uamoni ahothukumanacha vamoka, nkayeesha nipuro naya Umizpa. nkayees Attu o Uisraeli ni aholhelhi aya ni ayo aheesha nipuro naya Umizpa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Aholhelhi o Ugileadi nkayaakohanacha wo wiira, “Phi mpani etu nohalha uchokholha waatakana ikhoto ni attu o Uamoni? Nohalha wiira chiicho, phi nohalha ukhalha nholhelhi a attu onkhaye anokhalha Ugileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Nayefta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Paahi Ugileadi uwo ahokhalha ntu eehaniye Yeftha, yoyo ari ntu wooria waatakana, aayariye ni nthiyana o ulhuva, ni athumwanawe eehaniye Nagileadi. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Yayo Nagileadi ayo ahanaa achishana akina wa ahanu aya aakhalhana aya. Yayo achishana a ahanu a Nagileadi ayo ahomwomolha Yeftha wiira athame vawani vawo, amwiirelhaka wiira, “Uwe khurina ittu va yo uvahiya, ukhuma wo chittu cha athumwanihu, ukhalhawaya uwe uyariye ni nthiyana nkina.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Paahi Yeftha ahaattawa manyonnawe nkaarwaa ukhalha ilhapo yo Utobu. Wowo attu enchi aholhutaana ni uyo, nkayantwara kila waarwa awe.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Baada yo mahuku, attu o Uamoni ahaakelhelha attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Ikatema ikhoto vaathepa aya upharelha mooro, ashulhupalhe o Ugileadi ahorwaa ni waakusha Nayeftha ukhuma Utobu, <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />yeeraka wiira, “Nkawaani mmwe mwaaniholhelha unaatakana ihu ikhoto ni attu o Uamoni.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Nansho Nayeftha nkayeerelha ashulhupalhe o Ugileadi ayo wiira, “Chani woonaka mwahokivenga nkamwaakomolha wa manyaalhoko a athumwanaka? Ni vavawo chani woonaka nnokiweelha vano vanohuva inyu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Yayo ashulhupalhe o Ugileadi ayo nkayaakhulhacha wo wiira, “Phi nlhatu no utwarani wiira nnittukane vanorwaa ihu uwaatakanani ni attu o Uamoni, ni inyu nnookhalha nholhelhi ihu ni attu onkhaye o Ugileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Nayeftha nkayaathepa weerelha ashulhupalhe o Ugileadi ayo wiira, “Yakhalhaka nnookittukana waatakanani ni attu o Uamoni, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku akoorihaka waakottolha, vavawo mii kinookhalha nholhelhi inyu.”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Ashulhupalhe o Ugileadi nkayaakhulha Nayeftha, “Apwiiya Nlhuku anookhalha phi o unihimiechesha ihu. Wo ikekhiaye ninoopanga thoko chinre inyu wo wulhumacha.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Paahi Nayeftha nkayaattukana ashulhupalhe o Ugileadi alhe, ni attu ayo nkayaapanga ukhalha nholhelhi aya. Nayeftha nkayoolhumacha tho umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ittu yaathanana aya upangelhiya, Umizpa uwo.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Yamalheke, Nayeftha yahorweha nttenga wa amwene Naamoni yeerelhaka wiira, “Nnaanani ni hii, ata mmwe mwaatakana ikhoto wiilhaponi wihu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Ni amwene o Uamoni nkaakhulha wo wiira, “Attu o Uisraeli vaakhumilhe aya Umisri, ahokithurulha iwani aka ukhuma mwoolhoko wo Uamoni mpaka mwoolhoko wo Uyaboki, ni mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. Vano nkiholhoshereke etu iwani iyo wo mpuha.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Nayeftha nkaaruma tho akarumiya wa amwene Naamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />yaahimerie wo nlhatu waya wiira, “Attu o Uisraeli khayaakushilhe ilhapo ya attu o Umoabu mena iwani ya attu o Uamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Nansho attu o Uisraeli vaakhumilhe aya Umisri, yente uthakoni mpaka ibahari yo Ushamu mpaka Ukadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Yamalheke attu o Uisraeli ahaaruma akarumiya arwee wa amwene o Uedomu yaalhepelhaka wiira aahiyerere avirache iwani aya, nansho amwene o Uedomu ahokhota. Paahi nkayaalhepelha amwene o Umoabu ni ayo ahokhota. Paahi attu o Uisraeli nkayaahalha Ukadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Yamalheke aheeta nkwaha wo uvira uthakoni urukureriya ilhapo yo Uedomu ni Umoabu mpaka vaapilhe aya mpata uneelha nchuwa wo Umoabu, nkayeeshacha nipuro ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uarnoni. Nansho khayaakelhanche ilhapo yo Umoabu. Mwoolhoko wo Uarnoni phi waari mwiinano wo Umoabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Vavawo attu o Uisraeli ahaaruma akarumiya wa amwene Nasihoni o Uamori, uwo Uheshboni uwo. Nkayaalhepelha wiira aahiyerere avirache vawani waya, arwaache wiilhaponi waya. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Nansho Nasihoni ahaakhotelha attu o Uisraeli wiira avirache wiilhaponi waya. Paahi Nasihoni aheehana attu onkhaye, nkayeeshacha nipuro naya Uyahasa, nkayaakelhelha Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku a attu o Uisraeli, ahaakottolha Nasihoni vamoka ni attu aya, nkayaatakacha. Paahi attu o Uisraeli nkayaakushacha iwani yonkhaye ya attu o Uamoni yaakhalha aya iyo. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Yahokushacha ilhapo yonkhaye ya attu o Uamoni toka mwoolhoko wo Uarnoni mpaka mwoolhoko wo Uyaboki, ukhuma uthakoni mpata unosha nchuwa mpaka mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani uneelha nchuwa. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a attu o Uisraeli, nkayoomolhacha attu o Uamoni umihoolho wa attu o Uisraeli. Chani inyuva nnothanana unaakha ilhapo ihu? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Nthoshiyeke ni ilhe nlhuku inyu Kemoshi yuvanheni awe. Nansho ilhapo iriyoothe Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu, yoomonlhe aya anenchi o ilhapo iyo, nkayaanivaha hii, yeyo yawihu hii. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Chani nnoona wiira nhanaa machiri waapwaha Nabalaki anaaya Nazipora amwene o Umoabu? Yayo nkayaakhulhanne ni attu o Uisraeli ama waatakanana. <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Ikatema yonkhaye attu o Uisraeli aakhanlhe aya Uheshboni ni ittoko chaya, ni iwani yo Uaroeri ni ittoko chaya, vamoka ni iwani chonkhaye chaari vachereshere mwoolhoko wo Uarnoni, wo ikatema yo iyaakha imia ttaru, chani woonaka khamwookhonlhe ilhapo iyo vavawo? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Mii akinoottekelhani ittu, phi nlhatu etu nnoteka inyu vanokikelhelha inyu. Apwiiya Nlhuku phi o waamulha, yayo waamulha lhelho nna variyari wa attu o Uisraeli ni attu o Uamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Nansho amwene o Uamoni ahoheulhacha nttenga u Nayeftha uyo.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Yamalheke iphumu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakuruwelha Nayeftha, ni ayo nkayaathama ni uvira Ugileadi ni Umanase, nkayaahokholhia Umizpa, ilhapo yo Ugileadi ni urwaa mpaka Uamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Nayeftha nkayaanlhupelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku yeeraka wiira, “Yakhalhaka nnowaakottolha attu o Uamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />paahi ntu riyoothe nohalha ukhuma vathe unupani waka uwa ukikamelhani vanohokolhiaka baada yo waakottolha attu o Uamoni, yoyo nookhalha awinyu Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yoyo kinoukumiherani isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Paahi Nayeftha aholhapuwa mwoolhoko, nkayaatakana ni attu o Uamoni, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakottolha attu o Uamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Nkayaata, nkayaavara mateeka iwani makhumi meelhi munlhokoni mwa Aaroeri, ilhapo chaarukureria iwani yo Uminithi ni Uabelkeramimu. Paahi attu o Uamoni ahokottolhiya ni attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo mwaamwana mwanthiyana a Nayefta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Ikatema Nayeftha vaari aya mphironi ahokolhiaka uwannyaya, Umizpa, mwaamwanaya mwanthiyana ahothama uwa uweekamelhani eenaka ni woopa nipalhapata. Yoyo mwalhi uyo ari phi o yekha awe, kwaani Nayeftha khayaarina mwaana nkina nlhopwana ata nthiyana. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Paahi Nayeftha vaamonilhe aya, ahaahulha ikuwo chaya wo ukelhiya ihuzuni ni wiira, “O mwaamwanaka! Uhokikwiiha nrima aka. Uweva uhokhalha phi ittu yulhupalhe yo ukihelha ntatakoni. Ukhalhawaya hahaalhupelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni mii akinooria ukhota ulhupelha waka!”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, yakhalhaka mwaholhupelhelha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ittu, paahi nkipangelheke thoko chilhapenlhe inyu, ukhalhawaya vano ahowoorihani waalhivihera amalhaponi inyu ni waata attu o Uamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Nkaathepa weerelha athumwanawe wo wiira, “Ninouvendani etu ittu imoka, nkivaheke mieri miilhi, wiira kirwee umiakoni ni manyampwana aka, kechunlhenlhe urimeelha waka kihinaya uvekiya.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Athumwanawe nkayanhiyerera wiira arwee wowo wo mieri miilhi. Ni uyo nkaarwaa vamoka ni manyampwana awe, nkayonlhacha urimeelha wawe ahinaya uvekiya. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Baada yo mieri miilhi ahohokolhia vawani, Yamalheke athumwanawe nkayampangelha wo ulhikaana ni ulhupelha waya. Yoyo mwalhi uyo ari hinaatameriya ni nlhopwana riyoothe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Paahi toka vavawo, nkayaakhalha malhemalhelho wa attu o Uisraeli wiira, <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />kila iyaakha ashithiyana o Uisraeli anorwaa ulhapelhani wo mahuku macheshe urimeelha wa mwaamwana a Nayeftha o Ugileadi<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Makosho a Nayefta ni Naefraimu anowaanacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu ahothukumanacha, nkayaalhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani nkayaaphiyacha Uzafoni, ni weerelha Nayeftha wiira, “Chani woonaka khamwanihanne wiira nuuttukaneni naatakane ni attu o Uamoni? Vano etu, ninoopaha inupa inyu mwaanene nnari mwommo mpaani mmo.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Nansho Nayeftha nkaakhulha wo wiira, “Mii vamoka ni attu aka naari nihaathanaka chinene ni attu o Uamoni. Kahoulhepelhani wiira nkikavihe nansho khamwaawilhe ukookholha. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Voonilhe aka wiira khammwilhe ukikaviha, kahorwaa uno koovaka waatakana ni attu o Uamoni, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokivahera wiira kaakottolhe. Chani etu vano nnowaacha waatakana ni mii?”<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Paahi Nayeftha nkayaathukumaniha attu onkhaye o Ugileadi, nkayaatakana ikhoto ni attu o Efraimu. Attu o Ugileadi nkayaakottolhacha attu o Efraimu. Ni yayo attu o Efraimu ayo phi aahimmmie wiira, “Inyuva mwaatti attu o Ugileadi, inyuva phi attu mwaattawilhe ukhuma nikosho ni Naefraimu, nkamwaattawelha wa attu o nikosho ni Namanase.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Yamalheke, wo uthanana wiira attu ahikulhuphuwache, ahovara chittu cho ulhapuwelha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni utiyelhelha iphiro ya attu o ilhapo yo Efraimu. Kila nkwaha ntu aattawa vaaphiilhe awe vavawo, ni ulhepelha wiira avire, attu o Ugileadi yahonkoha, “Chani inyuva ntu o ilhapo yo Efraimu?” Aakhulhaka “Akihii,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />aamwiirelha wiireke, “Haya uromolheke Shibolethi”, nansho uyo eera “Sibolethi,” ukhalhawaya khoorilhe uromolha rata. Vavawo ahommara ni umwiiva wowo waalhapuwiya mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani uwo. Paahi attu maelufu makhumi ncheshe ni maelufu meelhi o nikosho ni Naefraimu aheevakachiya yeyo ikatema iyo.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Nayeftha ahokhalha o waamulha attu o Uisraeli wo iyaakha sita. Yamalheke ahorimeelha, nkayaavithiya Ugileadi, wiilhaponi waya.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Naibuzani, Naeloni ni Naabudoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Arimeelheke Nayeftha, Naibuzani o ukhuma Ubethlehemu ahokhalha o waamulha attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Yayo yaari ni achishana ashilhopwana makhumi mararu ni ashithiyana makhumi mararu chiicho. Ni yayo achishana ashithiyana ayo aavekihilhe wa attu o ukhuma makosho makina, ahiri o nikosho naya. Naibuzani nkayaakhalha o waamulha attu o Uisraeli iyaakha saba. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Nkaarimeelha nkaavithiya Ubethlehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Amalheke Naibuzani, Naeloni o nikosho ni Nazabuloni, ahokhalha o wamulha attu o Uisraeli wo iyaakha khumi. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Ni ayo ahorimeelha, nkaavithiya Uyiloni ilhapo yo nikosho ni Nazabuloni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Umalha wa Naeloni, Naabdoni anaaya Nahileli o ukhuma Upirathoni ahokhalha phi o wamulha attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Yayo ari ni achishana ashilhopwana khumi ni ncheshe ni uchuulhu ashaana khumi ni araru eeta wo uwelha iphuta khumi ni saba. Yayo ahokhalha o waamulha attu o Uisraeli iyaakha ncheshe. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Yamalheke, Naabdoni ahorimeelha, nkaavithiya Upirathoni ilhapo yo nikosho ni Naefraimu, ilhapo yo umiakoni Uamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Uyaria u Nasansoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Attu o Uisraeli ahowonyacha tho umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, paahi ni ayo nkaahiya atawariye ni Afilisti iyaakha khumi ni ncheshe.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Ni vavawo, ahokhalha ntu mmoka Usora uwo, o nikosho ni Unadani, nchina nawe eehaniye Manoa. Ahanu awe yoyo ari o uhiyara. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Nihuku nimoka nnepa a Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaakhumelhelha aathiyana ayo, nkeerelha wiira, “Inyu khannoyara khanrina mwaana. Nansho nnoorupalha irukulhu ni unnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Paahi etu mwiishungeke rata, nhiwuriye idivai ama ittu iriyoothe yo uhapalhiha ama nhilhie ittu iriyoothe ihinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />Ukhalhawaya nnoorupalha irukulhu ni unnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana. Vanohalha awe uyaria, ikharari chawe yoyo mwaana uyo mena chihihamiye, ukhalhawaya nookhalha ntakatifu a Apwiiya Nlhuku toka uyaria wawe. Ni uyo noochokholha wookholha attu o Uisraeli ukhuma utawara wa Afilisti.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Paahi aathiyana ayo nkaarwaa uwaahimeriani owannyaya wiira, “Ntu a Nlhuku ikhove awe thoko nnepa a Nlhuku ahokikhuruwelha. Akankohilhe khumme vayi mena ukoha nchina nawe. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Nansho aakirenlhe wiira kinoorupalha irukulhu ni unnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, nkaakilhehera wiira, kihiwuriye idivai ama utheka wala ulhia ittu iriyoothe ihinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya yoyo mwaana uyo nookhalha ntakatifu a Apwiiya Nlhuku toka uyaria wawe mpaka vanohalha awe urimeelha.”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Amalhiheke wulhumacha, Namanoa aholhepelha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku yeeraka wiira, “kinoulhepelhani inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, wiira munrumeke tho ntu inyu uyo, wiira aniittuchihe chittu chinothananiya ihu uphanga mwaana uyo vanohalha awe uyaria vawo.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayewelhelha nlhove ni Namanoa, ni nnepa a Nlhuku ulhe nkaankhuruwelha ahanu a Namanoa tho, vaari aya anakhanlhe umatani. Nansho owannyaya, yaani Namanoa khayaatamme vavawo yeyo ikatema iyo. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Paahi aathiyana ayo ahottimakacha, nkaarwaa uwaahimeriani owannyaya wiira, “Nkoonani! Ntu aakikhumelhenlhe nne nihuku nne, ahokikhumelhelha tho.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Namanoa ahonkwa ni urwaa waattukana ahanu aya mpaka wa ntu uyo, nkayankoha “Chani inyuva phi ulhe ntu ulhe aamulhumanne ulha nthiyana ulha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Ntu ulhe nkaakhulha eeraka, “Eiyo, phi mii.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Yamalheke, Namanoa nkeera, “Vano malhove inyu ayo vanohalha aya utimira vawo, niweeke naapanga ittu yaani inotwara wo nlhatu no mwaana uyo? Nipangekeni wo nlhatu wawe?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Nnepa a Apwiiya Nlhuku nkeerelha Namanoa wiira, “Ahanu inyu nvarechesheke chilheheriye aya chonkhaye chaahimenrie aka chiyo. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Ahilhawihe ittu iriyoothe inokhuma munzabibuni, ama ahiwuriye idivai ama utheka, wala ulhia ittu iriyoothe ihinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Apangeke kila ittu ilhehenre aka.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Namanoa nkaakhulha nnepa a Apwiiya Nlhuku eeraka, “Chonte nkhalheke vakani nuhithelheni mwaapuri.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Nnepa a Apwiiya Nlhuku uyo nkaakhulha Namanoa wo wiira, “Ata mwakikhanyererihaka wiira kikhalhe, akinolhia yolhia inyu. Nansho mwattunaka, mweesheke isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni, mwaakumihereke Apwiiya Nlhuku.” Namanoa ari ahichuwelhaka wiira yoyo arii nnepa a Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Paahi Namanoa nkaakhulha nnepa a Apwiiya Nlhuku uyo eeraka, “Nnihimerieke etu nchina ninyu wiira nithimiche ikatema malhove inyu vanohalha aya utimira.”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Nnepa a Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaakhulha, “Nnokoherera chani nchina naka, nchina naka nno nooshangiha?”<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Vavawo Namanoa ahonkusha mwaapuri ni ipepa, nkeesha vachulhu mwalha, wiira aakumihere Apwiiya Nlhuku anopanga chittu cho ushangiha. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Paahi ikatema Namanoa ni ahanu aya vaari aya awehaka malhimi o mooro vaawelha aya nchulhu wiirimu ukhuma vamadhubahuni vawo, ahomwoona nnepa mmalhimini mwo mooro ni uyo awelhaka urwaa wiirimu. Paahi Namanoa ni ahanu aya nkooroma. Namanoa nkayaachuwelha wiira ntu ulhe ari nnepa a Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Nnepa khaakumenlhe tho Namanoa ni ahanu aya.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Paahi Namanoa nkayeerelha ahanu aya wiira, “Wo ikekhiaye ninookhwa, ukhalhawaya nihomwoona Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Nansho ahanu aya nkayaakhulha wo wiira, “Yakaari Apwiiya Nlhuku aathanana uniiva khayaapochera isadaka ihu yo upahiya vamooroni ni yo ipepa iyo, wala khayaanooniha chechiyo chittu chiyi, wala yayo unilhehera ittu iriyoothe.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Yamalheke ahanu a Namanoa aheethapulha mwaana mwanlhopwana, ni Namanoa ahommaha nchina nawe Sansoni. Yoyo mwaana uyo ahonnuwa ni Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayamma ibarakha. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Iphumu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayoochokholha unkhomaalhiha vaari awe Umahanedani, iriyari wo Unasora ni Ueshtaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Nasansoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Nihuku nimoka, Nasansoni ahokhuruwelha Utimna waamoonilhe aya nthiyana mmoka Mfilisti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Vaahokolhia aya uwani ahaahimeria manyanaangoro aya wiira, “Kihomwoona nthiyana mmoka Nfilisti wowo Utimna uwo. Mwakivekiheke etu yoyo nthiyana uyo, kinthelhe.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Nansho manyanaangoro aya nkayeerelha wiira, “Chani, khaawo mwalhi riyoothe mmilhokoni mwa ashilhoko inyu, ama mwa attu ihu mpaka nrwee mwaveke wa Afilisti, attu o uhinelhiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Nansho Nasansoni nkaakhulha athumwanaya wo wiira, “Mwakivekiheke, yoyo phi nthiyana kichivenlhe unrimani chinene.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Nansho manyanaangoro aya khayaachuwelhanche wiira yoyo ari wo nlhatu na Apwiiya Nlhuku, vaavia aya iphiro yo waalhivihera Afilisti. Ukhalhawaya yeyo ikatema iyo Afilisti phi aatawara attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Paahi Nasansoni ni manyanaangoro aya wahorwaachiya Utimna. Vaapilhe aya wowo umamatani cho mizabibu, mwaakharamu mmoka ahaakhumelhelha nkeepa umihoolho u Nasansoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Paahi iphumu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakelha Nasansoni wo machiri, ni ayo ahommara mwaakharamu ulhe nkayamianiha thoko ntu vanommianiha awe mwaapuri. Nansho, mena khaahimenrie manyanaangoro aya yoyo mwaha uyo.<verse eid="JDG 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Yamalheke ahorwaa ni umuulhumana mwanthiyana ulhe, ni uyo ahaattuna chinene Nasansoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Avireke mahuku vakani ahorwaa tho Utimna uwo unkushani nthiyana uyo. Vaari aya mphironi ahoweha vachereshere nkoona ntembo wo kharamu ulhe, nkaashanga woona nchinga wo inwii ni urawo unari muntemboni mmo. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Paahi ahovaulha urawo wo miono chaya nkayaalhia uno arwaaka nkwaha aya. Vaahokholhelhe aya ahaavara manyanaangoro aya urawo vakani ni ayo nkayaalhia. Nansho khaatanganche wiira urawo uyo waakhumme mu ntembo wo kharamu.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Paahi athumwanawe nkaarwaa wa nthiyana ulhe, ni wowo Nasansoni ahoterekha ikaramu, thoko chaapanga aya ashimirawo o yayo mahuku ayo. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Afilisti voonilhe aya Nasansoni ahaawiihera ashimirawo khumi ni araru o waakhalhana. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Nasansoni nkayeerelha wiira, “Kinooria indaavi. Mwooriaka uthaphulha yeyo indaavi iyo mahuku saba o arusi aka, paahi kinouvahani miinjiro cho kitani makhumi mararu, ni miinjiro khumi ni ttaru cho uwara uarusini. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Nansho mwaahorieke uthaphulha, mwaatti nnookivaha mii miinjiro khumi ni miraru cho kitani ni miinjiro khumi cho uwara usikuukuni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Ni ayo nkayeeracha, “Aye, nrieke etu niiweke.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Nasansoni nkeera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Wa ntu nolhia wahokuma yolhia</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">wa ntu o machiri, wahokhuma uchiva.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Mahuku mararu kaanyuma, ashimirawo ayo ari khanaaya uthaphulha indaavi iyo.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Paahi nihuku no saba nkayeerelha ahanu a Nasamsoni wiira, “Mwaalhikacheke owannyu ayo wiira anithaphulhelhe indaavi ilha, nihiwe noopahani vamooroni, inyuva vamoka ni inupa ya athumwaninyu. Chani mwaanilhatunlhe vaa uwa uunaakhani nhakhu ihu?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Ahanu a Nasansoni nkaarwaa u Nasamsoni, miithori chaamoraka, nkayeerelha wiira, “Wo ikekhiaye nnookivenga, khannokittuna ata vakani. Nhaaria ashilhoko aka indaavi, nansho mena kannnakihimeria maana aya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Nasansoni nkaakhulha, “Mii akinaahimeria ata manyanaangoro aka. Vano kinohalha wooria chani uhimeriani inyuva?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Nansho aathiyana ayo ahothepa wunlha ikatema yonkhaye mahuku saba o uttapelhelhiya arusi ayo. Nihuku no saba Nasansoni ahaathaphulhelha ahanu aya ayo maana yo yeyo indaavi iyo, ukhalhawaya ahokhanyererihiya chinene. Ahimeriyeke, aathiyana ayo ahorwaa wo waakuvia ni waatangachera ashilhoko aya alhe. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Nihuku no saba nno nchuwa nihinaaya ukhuma, nkayeerelha Nasansoni wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Ittu yaani yoochiva thoko urawo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Phi mpani ntu o machiri umpwaha kharamu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Nasansoni nkayaakulha yeereka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Yakaari khanhuvilhe nlhatu wo indaavi aka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">khamwooria uthaphulha maana yo indaavi aka.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Paahi iphumu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku yahaakhuruwelha Nasansoni o machiri, ni ayo nkayaarwaa ilhapo yo Uashikeloni, nkayeevakacha attu makhumi mararu, nkayaakusha ikuwo chaya cho isikukuu, nkayaavaha attu aathaphunlhe indaavi aya alhe. Yamalheke nkayaarwaa uwani wa manyanaangoro aya anarushiye chinene wo ittu ipangelhe iyo. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Paahi, ahanu aya ayo ahovekihiya wa mmirawo mmoka eemelhenlhe arusi a Nasansoni.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s">Nasansoni anowaakottolha Afilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Avireke mahuku, ikatema yo nlhaalha wo ukhwachiya ingaano, Nasansoni ahonkusha mwaapuri, nkaarwaa uwaashikuriani ahanu aya. Nkayoolhumana ahokohi aya wo weerelha wiira, “Kinothanana urwaa uchuumbani wa ahanu aka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:1">Nansho ahokohi ayo ahachiichiha wiira ahikelhe. <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Nkeerelha Nasansoni wiira, “Miyaano kahochuwelha wiira khamwaattunne mena. Paahi kahaathelhiha ampwana inyu. Ata inakhalhaka chiicho, vaa ahaawo nhima aya. Munthelheke etu yoyo baada yo ayo.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Nasansoni nkaakhulha wo wiira, “Vano, kinokhalha ni nlhatu wo ukhuwachiya, wo nlhatu wo ittu kinohalha aka waapangelha Afilisti iyo.”<verse eid="JDG 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Paahi Nasamsoni nkaarwa, nkaavara anancheto imia ttaru ni waattuka miilha chaya vamoka eelhi elhi. Yamalheke nkayeesha nttuko wo kila anancheto eelhi elhi. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Vaamalhinhe aya uparihelha mithuko ni waahiyacha anancheto ayo, aattawelhanche mmamatani mwa Afilisti nkayaapahacha mooro ihiru cho ingaano, ni ingaano yaari ihinaya ukhunguriya, ni upaha ni miri cho mizeituni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Afilisti vaakohananche aya wiira mpani pangilhe yayo, ahaakhulhiya wiira, “Nasansoni, nhokohi naya yayo, phi pangilhe yeyo ittu iyo, wo nlhatu wo ahokohi aya waathelhiha ahanu a Nasansoni wa mmirawo mmoka yeemelhenlhe Nasamsoni u arusini.” Paahi Afilisti ahorwaacha nkayampaha mooro nthiyana ulhe vamoka ni athumwanawe.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Nasansoni nkeerelha Afilisti wiira, “Ukhalhawaya nihopanga chittu thoko chechiyo, paahi kinoulhupelha wiira akinothama va mpaka vanohalha aka uhokolhoshera.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Paahi Nkaatakacha chinene ni weevakacha attu enchi. Yamalheke, nkayaarwaa uukhalhani unikhukuni umwalhani Uetamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasansoni anowakottolha Afilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Paahi Yamalheke yayo, Afilisti ahowaacha nkayeesha nipuro naya ilhapo yo Uyuda ni uchokholha ukelhelha ilhapo yo Ulehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Attu o ilhapo yo Uyuda nkayaakoha, “Chani nnonaatakacherani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Ni ayo nkayaakulha wiira, “Kipangilhe thoko chipangilhe aya ni ayo uwannyaka.”<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Paahi attu maelufu mararu o ukhuma Uyuda ahorwaa unikhukuni umwalhani Uetamu u Nasansoni ni weerelha wiira, “Chani kanchuwenlhe wiira Afilisti phi anonitawara hii? Paahi nkoonani chinre inyu wo unithapaniha!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">Nasansoni Nkaakhulha eeraka, “Thoko chipangenlhe aya, ni mii phinre aka wo waapangelha chiicho.”<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Attu ayo ni ayo nkeera, “Paahi etu nihowa nuuttukeni ni urweeheni uwannaya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Nasansoni nkaakhulha, “Nkilhupelheke etu wiira mwaatti mwaashinene khannokiva.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Ni attu ayo nkaathepa wiira, “Hii khaninowiivani, nansho ninouttukani etu ni urweehani uwannyaya.” Paahi nkaattuka wo mikhoyi cho naanano piilhi ni waakumiha nnikhukuni mmo. <verse eid="JDG 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Vaapilhe aya Ulehi, Afilisti ahottimakacha uwa attapelhelhaka. Nansho wo uhikhulhuvelhiya iphumu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku yahaakhuruwelha Nasansoni o machiri ni mikhoyi chaathukiye aya mmiononi waya chilhe nkachaakwatuwacha thoko ikitani ivanre mooro, nkachaathaphuwa nkachaamora vathi. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Nasansoni nkayoona nikhuva no nrama no iphuta, nkayaarokotta ni uphanga ikerero yo weevelha attu, nkayeevakacha attu elufu imoka. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Paahi Yamalheke Nasansoni aheepa Ichipo neera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kiheevakacha attu elufu imoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">wo waata mi wo nikhuva no nrama no iphuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">Wo nenno nikhuva no nrama no iphuta nno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">kihokhupacha mapuhe o mitembo.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Vaamalhinhe aya wulhumacha, ahoriha nrama nno vathi. Vavawo vakittu etu nkaweehaniya Ramathlehi, maana aya mwaako wo nikhuva no nrama.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Yamalheke Nasansoni ahowolhiya nttona chinene. Paahi nkayaalhepelha Apwiiya Nlhuku yeeraka wiira, “Inyu Nlhuku, phi inyuva mmwihilhe ulha noopo ulha, wo ukiruma mii karumiya inyu. Chani vano nnokihiya wiira kikhwe wo nttona ni uvariya mateeka ni Afilisti o uhineelhiya alha?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Nansho Nlhuku nkaapatakulha vakittu vaari ni nlhikiti Uleki uwo, nkaakhoolhiha maashi. Nasansoni nkaawuria maashi ni machiri aya nkayaahokolhelha. Nnno nrapo nno nkaneehaniya, Enhakore, ni nno nihaawo Ulehi uwo mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Nasansoni nkaakhalha ntu o waamulha a attu o Uisraeli iyaakha makhumi meelhi, ikatema ya Afilisti.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Nasansoni Ugaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Nihuku nimoka Nasansoni ahoorwa iwani yo Ugaza, nkayaakumaana ni nthiyana o ulhuva mmoka nkayaarupana. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Attu o ilhapo yo Ugaza veerelhiye aya wiira Nasansoni arii wowo, ahorukureria vakittu vaari aya vawo ni weethelha urii nkhora o iwani uhiyu woothene. Nkayaashelhelhiha anakhanlhe shiriri vankhorani vawo uhiyu wonkhaye aanyiheraka wiira anowooria waaweherera mpaka vanosha aya nchuwa wiira eeviyeke. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Nansho Nasansoni nkayaahalha vawani vawo mpaka uhiyu chinene. Ikatema yo uhiyu chinene nkayouwa nkayaavara miri miilhi cho nkhora, nkayaaphelha vamoka ni kila chaya nkayaakusha ni urwaana mpaka vakhiviru ni Uhebroni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Delila nowaathumiha Nasansoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Baada yo yayo Nasansoni ahonttuna nthiyana mmoka eehaniye Delila aakhalha unikoteni Usoreki <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Ashulhupalhe athanu a Afilisti ahorwaa wa Delila, ni umwiirelha wiira, “Waapepecheke Nasansoni wiira nchuwelheke machokholhelho o machiri aya menchi ayo, wiira noorie waavara ni waattuka. Mwapangaka chiicho kila mmoka ihu nouvahani ikipande makhumi mamaru cho isiliva.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Paahi Delila aheerelha Nasansoni wiira, “Chonte nkihimerie machiri inyu anokhuma ni ittu yaani, ntu nohalha wooria chani uwaatani ni uttukani?”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Nasansoni nkayaakulha, “Akittukaka wo mikhoyi saba chikithi cho muupa kinokhalha ni machiri thoko ntu riyoothe.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Paahi ashulhupalhe a Afilisti nkayaamwiihera Delila mikhoyi saba cho muupa chiyo, ni ayo nkhayaattuka Nasansoni wo chechiyo mikhoyi chiyo. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delila ari aneeshilhe attu avithelhe uchuumbani. Yamalheke nkayeerelha Nasansoni wo nlhove nuulhupalhe wiira, “Nasansoni, Afilisti ahowaacha ukelhelha.” Nasansoni nkayathupulhacha mikhoyi chiyo thoko nripwe o ikitani chinovara aya mooro. Paahi etu khaawo aachuwenlhe isiri yo machiri aya.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila nkayeerelha Nasamsoni wiira, “Inyuva nhokipangelha ncheche. Nhokithepia. Chonte nnilhelhe chinohalha wooria inyuva uttukiya.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Nasansoni Nkaakhulha, “Akittukaka wo mikhoyi cho naanano chihipangelhiye ntheko, kinookhalha thoko ntu riyoothe.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Paahi Delila ahokusha nkhoyi wo naanano, nkaattuka. Yamalheke nkeerelha Nasansoni wo nlhove nuulhupalhe, “Nasansoni! Afilisti ahowacha wiira oovareni!”<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila nkeerelha Nasamsoni wiira, “Mpaka nna nnokipangelha ncheche. nnilhelhe nnore inyu uthukiya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Nasamsoni nkayaakhulha, “Mwativakaru ikharari chaka saba cho ikharari chaka u upumbulhuni o kuwo ni uttuka chinene wo ikhomo, kinokhalha thoko ntu riyoothe.”<verse eid="JDG 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Paahi Nasamsoni vaari aya anarupilhe Delila ahotiva vamoka ikharari chi Nasamsoni mangoongo saba, nkaatuka wo mphumburu wo ikuwo ni uttuka nti chinene wo ikhomo. Yamalheke aheerelha Nasamsoni wiira, “Nasamsoni! Afilisti anoowacha uuvarani.” Vavawo attu ari uchuumbani eethelhaka, Nasamsoni nkayaakwatulha mikhoyi chiyo thoko nttoche.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Paahi Delila nkeerelha Nasansoni wiira, “Nnooriya chani wiira nnookittuna, uno nrima inyu khuuri ni mii? Nhokipangelha ncheche, vano ulha nkwaha uneraru. Khannakihimeria machiri inyu anokhuma vayi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Delila vaathepa awe waakoha Nasamsoni chinene malhove menchi, nihuku baada yo nihuku, ni waathunalhiha Nasansoni ata nkayoocha munrimani mwaya aatameriaka ukhwa, <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />khayoonrie uvilhelha, nkaathaphulha isiri yaavitha aya yeeraka, “Ikharari chaka kachinahamiya toka uyaria waka. Mii kihopangiya ntakatifu a Apwiiya Nlhuku toka munthukwani mwa anumwanaka. Yakhalhaka kinoohamiya, machiri aka anookhuma, ni mii kinookhalha thoko ntu riyoothe.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Paahi Delila voonne awe wiira Nasansoni ahohimiya ittu yaavitha aya yonkhaye, aheehana ashulhupalhe a Afilisti, nkayeerelha wiira, “Nkawaani nkwaha mmoka etu ulha, wo nlhatu ni Nasansoni, ukhalhawaya ahokihimeria ittu yaakivithilhe aya yonkhaye.” Ashulhupalhe a Afilisti nkayaanrwelha Delila uno akushachaka isiliva chaalhenhe wiira anowaavaha. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Nadelila nkayaapanga Nasansoni wiira arupe ikhove vamakuthani waya, nkaamwiihana ntu awe aahama Nasansoni ikharari chaya mangoongo chilhe saba alhe. Yamalheke Nadelila nkayaachokholha watwarusha Nasamsoni, ukhalhawaya vano machiri ahaakhuma. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Yamalheke, nkayeerelha Nasamsoni wiira, “Nasamsoni! Afilisti anoowacha ukelhelha!” Nasansoni nkayoowa uno opuwelhaka wiira anookhuma ni wiichoopolha thoko mpacho vawo. Khaachuwenlhe wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku yaari anaahiyalhe. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Afilisti ahaavara Nasansoni, nkayaapweshakacha miitho, nkayaarweha Ugaza, nkayaattuka mittondoro cho shaba, ni waakhanyereriha uphanga ntheko yo ushilha ipepa ujeerani uwo. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Nansho ikharari chaya nkachachokholha wunnuwa tho baada yo uhamiya.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukhwa u Nasansoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Yamalheke ashulhupalhe a Afilisti ahokumaana wiira attapelhelhe ni unkumihera isadaka nlhuku aya eehaniye Dagoni. Paahi nkayaakhalhacha ni wiipacha eeraka, “Nlhuku ihu honhelha mmiononi mwihu mmalhaponi ihu Sansoni.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Attu voonilhe aya Nasansoni nkayanthimicha nlhuku aya ni wiira, “Nlhuku ihu ahonhelha mmiononi mwihu mmalhaponi ihu, aatangannye iwani ihu ni weeva attu enchi ihu.”<verse eid="JDG 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Mirima chaya vaateelhachiye aya nkeera, “Mwaawiiheke Nasamsoni awe yeena.” Paahi nkayaakhumiha Nasamsoni ujeerani, nkayaawiiha ni ayo nkayeena. Nkayeeshiya variyari nipoto. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Nasamsoni nkayamwiirelha mmirawo yaari aaholhelha uyo, “Nkihiyeherere kaapapelhe mapoto avarenlhe inupa wiira ni mii kirupelhe.”<verse eid="JDG 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Yeyo inupa iyo yaari inachanre attu. Ashulhupalhe onkhaye a Afilisti ari vavawo, ni akina ari inupa yo uchulhu, attu maelufu mararu manyaalhopwana ni manyaathiyana, awehaka Nasansoni veena aya.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Vavawo Nasamsoni nkayaalhepelha Apwiiya Nlhuku yeeraka, “Athithi Apwiiya Nlhuku kinoulhepelhani wiira nkuupuwelhe. Nkihelheke machiri, nkwaha ulha mmoka, inyu Nlhuku wiira kilhivererihe nkwaha mmoka ulha Afilisti apwenshe miitho aka.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Paahi Nasamsoni nkayaavara mapoto o veriyari aavarenlhe ulhemelha wonkhaye wo inupa iyo, moono mmoka nipoto nimoka ni moono nkina nipoto no nayeelhi nno. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Yamalheke nkeera wiira, “Kikhweeke vamoka ni Afilisti alha.” Nkayaakakha wo machiri aya onkhaye. Inupa nkayaawulhuwelha ashulhupalhe onkhaye a Afilisti ari mwommo nnupani mmo. Attu eeviye ari enchi waapwaha alhe eevakachilhe aya ikatema vaari aya nkumi alhe.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Ashilhoko aya ni ashihima aya onkhaye ahowa ni waakusha, nkayaavitha variyari iwani yo Usora ni iwani ya Ueshtaoli, urii nihiye ni Namanoa, athumwanaya. Nasansoni arii ntu o waamulha attu o Uisraeli iyaakha makhumi meelhi.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo isinyago cha Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Yayo mahuku ayo ahokhalha ntu mmoka umwaakoni Efraimu, nchina nawe eehaniye Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Nihuku nimoka aheerelha anumwanawe wiira, “Ikipande elufu imoka ni imia imoka cho isiliva mweeyeriye inyu, ni inyu kamwanlhava owiiyenreni ni kiiwaka chilhe, mii kihanaa. Mii phi akunshe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Anumwanawe nkeera wiira, “Apwiiya Nlhuku ovahereke ibarakha Mwaamwanaka.” <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Namika nkaahokolhoshera anumwanaya ikipande elufu imoka ni imia imoka cho isiliva. Anumwanaya nkeera wiira, “Nansho ulhava waka kaalhanve aka uwo, uhuupwanyeni, chilha isiliva chilha kinoowaavaha Apwiiya Nlhuku, wiira chahanelhiye isinyago. Vano etu, kinouhokolhosherani ikipande cho isiliva chiyo.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Namika vaahokholhenshere aya anumwanaya ikipande cho isiliva chiyo, anumwanaya ahokusha ikipande imia piilhi cho isiliva, nkayaavaha attu anohana isiliva, ni ayo nkayaakoorosha isinyago yo uhemiya ni yo uthulhushiya. Yeyo isinyago iyo nkayeeshiya mpaani inupa i Namika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Yayo Namika ayo ahanaa vakittu vaya vaathimichera aya. Ahokoorosha ikizibau ya opochera ishaani ni isinyago, Yamalheke nkayampanga mmoka a achishana aya mwanthiyana ukhalha opochera ishaani aya. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Yayo mahuku ayo khaariwo mwene o ilhapo ya attu o Uisraeli. Kila ntu aapanga ittu iriyoothe yoonilhe awe wiira yanlhoka.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Ni yeyo ikatema iyo ahokhalha mmirawo mmoka Nlawi iwani yo Ubethlehemu ilhapo i Nayuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Yoyo mmirawo uyo ahorwaa Ubethlehemu ilhapo i Nayuda, uuthothani vakittu vakina vo ukhalha. Nkwaha awe nkawaaphiya ilhapo yo miako u Naefraimu, unupani wa Namika. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Namika nkayankoha, “Nkumilhe vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Ni uyo nkaakhulha wo wiira, “Mii Nlawi, kinokhuma ilhapo yo Ubethlehemu, iwani i Nayuda. Kinaavia vakittu wo ukhalha.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Namika nkeera wiira, “Nkhalheke etu vamoka ni miyaano va, nkhalheke uwannyaka va. Nkhalheke athumwanaka ni opochera ishaani aka. Kinoulhivani ikipande khumi cho isiliva kila iyaakha ni miinjiro vamoka ni ittu nnohalha inyu uthanana iriyoothe ilhe.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Yoyo Nlawi uyo nkaakelha ni urumelhelha, nkaakhalha wowo ni ukhalha thoko mmoka a achishana a Namika. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Ni Namika nkayampanga yoyo mmirawo Nlawi uyo ukhalha opochera ishaani unupani waya uwo. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Yamalheke nkeera wiira, “Vano kinoochuwelha wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku anookivahera, ukhalhawaya kihaana mmirawo Nlawi ulha rii opochera ishaani aka.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha u Namika ni attu o nikosho ni Unadani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Yayo mahuku ayo khaariwo mwene o ilhapo yo attu o Uisraeli. Paahi attu o nikosho ni Unadani naari naaviaka vakittu waya wo ukhalha mwommo, ukhalhawaya mpaka ikatema ilha, yaari ahinameelhiya vakittu waya ashinene mmilhokoni mwo makosho a attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Paahi, attu o nikosho ni Unadani ahonthanlha mmunlhokoni mwaya attu o machiri, nkayaaruma ukhuma Ueshtaoli uwo ni Uasora wiira arwaache yahotelhe ilhapo. Paahi attu ayo nkayaaphiya ilhapo yo miako cho Efraimu, uwani wa Namika, nkayaakhalhacha wowo. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Vaari aya uwani u Namika, ahochuwelhacha nlhove na mmirawo Nlawi ulhe. Nkayanrukunuwelha ni ukoha, “Mpani owiihilheni uno? Nnopanga ntheko waani vaa?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Yoyo nkaakhulha eeraka, “Namika ahopanga ittu ni mii, ahokivaha ntheko ni mii kihokhalha opochera ishaani aya.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Ni ayo nkayaamwiirelha wiira, “Chonte nnikoherere wa Apwiiya Nlhuku yakhalhaka nkwaha ihu ulha unookhalha woombone.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Opochera ishaani ulhe nkeelha wiira, “Nrwaacheke wo mpuha. Apwiiya Nlhuku anowinkelhani munkwahani mwinyu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Paahi attu athanu ayo kayaarwacha Ulaishi. yaahona attu aakhanlhe wowo, ni yongomme aya wo mpuha thoko valhe attu o ilhapo yo Usidoni. Yaari attu o maalha shiriri o uhikhalhe ni nipesha ni kawuukulhiye vakittu variyoothe velhaponi, vaari aya utayi ni attu o Usidoni, ni kayarina ni ntheko uriyoothe ni attu akina.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Paahi yayo attu o uhotelha ayo ahohokolhiacha wa ashilhoko aya Usora ni Ueshtaoli uwo, ni ayo nkayaakoha yiiraka wiira, “Nnoniwiihera nttenga waani?” <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Yayo manyaattu ayo nkeera, “Munkwacheke nngwee nikelhelhe iwani iyo. Nihoona iwani iyo iri yo ichaayira. Chani nnookhalhacha vava wo uhipanga ittu iriyoothe ilhe? Nhicherewe urwaa mwakhalhelhe iwani iyo. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Mwaphiyaka wowo nnokowaaphwanya attu ahiri ni mirima cho nipampa. Yeyo iwani iyo yuulhupalhe, kinowukulhelhiya ittu iriyoothe ilhe, ni Nlhuku homalha ukottolhelha.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Paahi attu imia sita o nikosho ni Unadani avaraka ikerero chaya cho ikhoto ahorwaa ukhuma Usora ni Ueshtaoli, <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />nkayaarwacha weesha nipuro naya Ukiriathyearimu uwo, wi iwani i Nayuda. Paahi wo chiichammo etu phi nlhatu vavawo vakittu vawo mpata uneelha nchuwa Ukiriathyearimu vaheehaniya aya Mahanedani maana aya nipuro ni Unadani mpaka lhelho nna. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Ukhuma wowo nkayaarwacha iwani yo miako yo Efraimu, nkayaaphiyacha vawani wa Namika<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Yalhe attu athanu yaarwelhe uhotelhani iwani ya Laishi alhe nkayeerelha alhoko aya wiira, “Chani nhochuwelha wiira inupa imoka yo chechiyo, ihaawo ikizibau ni isinyago yo uthulhushiya? Paahi muupuwelheke ittu yo uphanga.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Paahi yalhe attu o uhotelha alhe nkayaarwacha unupani wa Namika, nkayaakelhacha mpaani ni ukoha chittu cha mmirawo Nlawi ulhe. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Yeyo ikatema iyo attu imia sita o nikosho ni Unadani yaari ni ikerero chaya cho ikhoto alhe yaari anemenlhe vankhorani. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Ni attu athanu aarwelhe uhotelhani iwani alhe ahokelhacha mpaani, nkayakusha isinyago ya nlhuku yo uthulhushiya ilhe, ikizibau ni isinyago ulhapelhiya. Yeyo ikatema opochera ishaani alhe ari aneemenlhe vankhorani vamoka ni attu imia sita ari ni ikerero alhe.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Paahi voonne aya attu o uhotelha alhe ahokelhacha vawani Namika ahokusha isinyago yo uhemiya, ni nrupa, isinyago ni isinyago yo uthulhushiya ilhe, nkayaakoha, “Noopangani?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Ni ayo nkayeeracha, “Mmaalhe. Nhuulhumache ittu iriyoothe. Mmweeke vamoka ni hii va, nkhalheke opochera ishaani ihu ni thoko athumwanihu. Ama nnoona chani? Chani nnoona wiira inoolhoka ukhalha opochera ishaani a ntu mmoka, ama ukhalha opochera ishaani o attu nikosho nimoka no attu o Uisraeli?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Opochera ishaani uyo ahoteelhiya nrima chinene, nkaakusha nrupa ulhe, isinyago yo uthimichiya ilhe, ni ilhe isinyago ya nlhuku yo uthulhushiya, nkaatwaraana ni ayo.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Paahi nkaachokholha nkwaha aya, uno aholhelhiyaka ni achishana aya, ni mihuwo ni mihakhu chaya. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Vaaphilhe aya utayi ni iwani i Namika, attu yaatamanne ni Namika aheehanachiya, nkaatwara attu o nikosho ni Unadani ni waaphiyelha. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Yamalheke nkayaakhuwelhacha, ni attu o nikosho ni Unadani ahorukunuwacha, nkayaankoha Namika yiiraka wiira, “Nnohuvani mpaka nkamwanitwara vamoka ni nkutiro wonkhaye ulha?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Namika nkayaakhulha yeeraka wiira, “Mwaatti nhokusha milhuku chaka chaakooroshilhe aka, nhaakusha ni opochera ishaani aka nkamwaakihiya wo uhikhalhe ni ittu iriyoothe ilhe. Nnooria chani etu ukihoha wiira kinohuvani?”<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Attu o nikosho ni Unadani nkayereeracha, “Nambaya nhinyakulhe, ukhalhawaya mwaahireke chiicho, akhunanihu akina enchi anoorushiya, anowooria ukelhelha, ni inyu nkamwaarimeelha vamoka ni ashilhoko inyu.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Namika voonne aya wiira ahopwahiya machiri, ahorukunuwa nkayaahokholhia uwaani, ni attu o nikosho ni Unadani nkayaarwacha.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Yayo attu o nikosho ni Unadani ayo yahokushacha chittu chaakoronshe aya Namika chilhe, nkankusha ni opochera ishaani ampangenlhiya aya namitheko aya ulhe. Paahi nkayarwaa ni waakelhelha attu o ilhapo yo Ulaishi nkayeevakacha attu aya aakhalhacha mwommo wo mpuha ayo, ni urimeelhiha iwani iyo. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Ni mena kaakhanlhe ni ntu o wookholha ukhalhawaya yaari utayi ni iwani yo Usidoni, tho, khayaari ni unlhoko ni attu o iwani chikina. Yeyo iwani iyo yaari nikoote no Ubethrehobu. Attu o nikosho ni Unadani nkayathekacha tho iwani iyo, nkayaakhalhacha wowo. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Nkayaavaha nchina nikina iwani iyo, nkayeehana Dani, utwaarana ni nchina na apwiiya aya ari anayaa Naisraeli. Nansho yeyo iwani iyo mpacho vawo yeehaniya Ulaishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Yamalheke, attu o nikosho ni Unadani aheemeshacha isinyago yo uhemiya ilhe, ni Nayonathani, anaaya Nagershomu anaaya ashinna Musa, nkayaakhalha opochera ishaani aya. Ayari aya ni ayo ahokhalha opochera ishaani o nikosho ni Unadani mpaka attu o iwani iyo vaarwehiye aya ulhetoni. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Ikatema yonkhaye Nihema na Nlhuku vaari aya Ushilo uwo, attu o nikosho ni Unadani ahothimicha isinyago yo uhemiya yaakoroshilhe aya Namika.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Mwaha wa Nlawi ni namitheko awe nthiyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Yeyo ikatema iyo attu o Uisraeli vaari aya ahiri ni mwene, ahokhalha Nlawi mmoka aakhalha thoko nlheto utayi, umiakoni Efraimu. Yoyo ntu uyo ahonkusha nthiyana mmoka o Ubethlehemu iwani i Nayuda ukhalha namitheko awe. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Nansho namitheko nthiyana uyo ahonthunalhelha Nlawi uyo, nkanhiya ni uhokolhia uwannyawe wa athumwanawe Ubethlehemu uwo, nkaakhalha wowo mieri micheshe. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Nihuku nimoka owannyawe ayo ahothama ni urwaa umwaaviani, athananaka wiira amuulhumane rata ni wiira anhokolhiane uwannyaya. Paahi yoyo nlhopwana uyo ahorwaa vamoka ni namitheko awe ni iphuta piilhi. Paahi nthiyana ulhe nkaarweha mpaani wa athumwanawe, ni ahokohi ayo vaamwoonilhe awe nkayampochera wo untapelhelha. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Ahokohi ayo ahaapochera Nlawi uyo rata, ni uyo ahokhalha wowo wo mahuku mararu, nkayaalhia, nkaawuria ni urupa vamoka ni nthiyana uyo wowo. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Nihuku no necheshe, ahonkwa wichishuru, nkaattukacha chittu wiira ahokholhiache, nansho athumwanawe nthiyana uyo nkeera, “Nlhiyeeke yolhia vakani thoko, mpatteke machiri, yamalhaka nthameke nrweeke.”<verse eid="JDG 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Paahi yayo attu eelhi ayo ahokhalhacha, nkayaalhia ni uwuria vamoka. Yamalheke ahokohi aya ayo nkayeerelha wiira, “Chonte nrupeke va ulha uhiyu ulha tho, mpuheke.”<verse eid="JDG 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Nlawi ulhe veemenlhe awe wiira athame arwee, ahokohi ayo nkaamwiirelha wiira hithame, ni uyo ahokhalha wo uhithama. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Nihuku no nethanu, yoyo ntu uyo ahonkwa wichishuru, athananaka uthama. Nansho athumwanawe nthiyana ulhe nkayaamwiirelha wiira, “Nlhieke yoolhia wiira mpatteke machiri, nlhiteke mpaka uchechilho, vavawo nthameke nrweeke.” Paahi eelhi ayo onkhaye nkayaalhia vamoka.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Ni Nlawi uyo, namitheko awe nthiyana ni namitheko awe nkina ulhe vonkwilhe aya wiira athame arwaache, ahokohi awe ayo ahomwiirelha Nlawi uyo wiira, “Vano woonaka uheelha, nlhieke yolhia, nrupeke vava. Meelho wichishu munkweke mapikoosha, nchokholheke nkwaha inyu wo uhokolhia uwaninyu.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Nansho yoyo ntu uyo nkaakhota urupa wowo yoyo uhiyu uyo. Paahi ahothama ni urwaa, nkaaphiya vakhiviru ni iwani ya Ayebusi yaani Uyerusalemu. Aathamme ni iphuta chawe piilhi chaathanlhiye tayari vamithanani waya, vamoka ni namitheko awe nthiyana ulhe. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Vaari aya anatamenrie iwani yo Uyebusi, waari unelhilhe, paahi namitheko ulhe nkeerelha owannyawe awe ayo wiira, “Vano nambaya niphiyelhe ilha iwani ya Ayebusi ilha, nirupelheke mwommo uhiyu ulha.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Owannyawe ayo nkaakhulha wo wiira, “Khaninorukunuwa ni ukelha iwani yo alheto ahiri attu o Uisraeli. Nirweeke mpaka Ugibea. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Nngwee naatamerieke vavawo vakittu vawo, narupelheke wowo Ugibea uwo ama Uraama.”<verse eid="JDG 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Paahi nkayaarwacha mpaka nchuwa nkanaatipheelha vaari aya vakhiviru ni iwani yo Ugibea, iri phi iwani yo attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Nkayaakelhacha vawani vawo wiira arupelhe wowo uhiyu uyo. Nansho, vaakenlhe aya vawani vawo ahorwaa nkayaakhalha vakittu vaari ipuwa voowoonia, kwaani khaawo ntu aapochenre unupani wawe.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Vaari aya wowo, ahowa ntu mmoka o wuulhuvalha aakhuma umatani wawe. Yoyo ntu uyo ari nnenchi o ilhapo yo umiakoni yo Efraimu, aakhalha Ugibea thoko nlheto. Anenchi o iwani yo Ugibea iyo ari attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Yoyo ntu uyo vaawenhe awe ni umwoona ntu ri munkwahani nakhalhe va ipuwa voonene vawo, ahokoha, “Mwaatti nnokhumacha vayi, nnokhelha uyi?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Ni ayo nkaamwaakhulha eeraka, “Ninokhuma Ubethlehemu ilhapo i Nayuda, ninokelha vakittu wo utayi umiakoni Efraimu, wowo phi anokhalha aka. Ni vaa khaawo ntu nipochenre unupani wawe. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Nansho inakhalhaka chiicho, hi anamitheko inyu va, nihokusha manyashi o ulhiha iphuta chihu chi. Tho, nihanaa nkatte ni idivai, chechiyo chinookithosha mii, nthiyana ulha, ni namitheko aka ulha. Khaniwukuwelhiye ni ittu iriyoothe.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Ntu o wulhuvalha uyo nkeerelha wiira, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu mwaatti! Kinouvahani chittu chonkhaye chinothanana inyu. Nansho nhirupe uno voonene va.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Paahi ahaarweeha uwannyawe ni ulhiha iphuta chaya. Yayo alheto ayo ahokhuchacha mieto chaya, nkayaalhia ni uwuria.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Vaari aya awuriaka vawo, manyaalhopwana o mirima cho uhilhoka o iwani iyo ahowaacha nkayaarukureriya inupa iyo ni uhodisha vankhorani. Nkayeerelha anene inupa ayo wiira, “Munkumihe vathe uno nlhopwana uyo wiilhe uwaninyu uyo, ninthelhakache.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Nansho anene inupa ayo ahokhuma vathe, nkayeerelha wiira, “Nhiire chiicho ashilhoko aka, kinoulhelhani wiira nhiwonye chommo. Ulha nlheto aka, paahi nhimpangelhe ittu yo uholhoka iyo. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Kihanaa mwaamwanaka mwanthiyana hinathupha mooro, ni tho ahaawo namitheko nthiyana a nlheto aka. Nkihiyerereke etu kaakumihache vathe, mwaakusheke yayo ni waapangelha thoko chinothanana inyu, nansho ulha ntu ulha nhipangelhe ittu yo wuulhiha muru iyo.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Nansho manyaalhopwana ayo khayeewelhenlhe. Paahi Nlawi ulhe ahonkusha namitheko awe nthiyana ulhe nkankumiha ni waavaha vathe uwo. Ni ayo nkayankusha ni unrupana uhiyu woothe mpaka wichishu. Vaatameria aya usha, nkayanhiyacha arwee.<verse eid="JDG 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Wichishu, nthiyana ulhe ahowa mpaka vankhorani wo inupa yaari aya owannyawe, nkaawulhuwa vathi vankhorani vawo ni ukhalha vavawo mpaka wichishu. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Owannyawe ayo vonkwilhe aya wichishu, ahohulha nkhora wo inupa, nkayaakhuma vathe wiira achokholhe nkwaha aya. Wo uthuthuwelha nkayamphwanya namitheko nthiyana aya narumpe vathi vankhorani, miono chawe chinavarenlhe nipoto no nkhora. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Nkaamwiirelha, “Mweemelheke nngwee.” Nansho khaakhunlhe ittu. Nkayanthesha nkayaamweesha vachulhu iphuta aya ni unrwaana mpaka uwannyawe. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Vaaphilhe awe uwannyawe ahokusha mwaalho ni untupulhacha namitheko nthiyana ulhe ikipande khumi ni piilhi. Yamalheke nkaarweha ikipande chiyo ilhapo yonkhaye ya attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Kila ntu oonilhe ittu yeyo iyo aheera, “Ittu thoko yelha khinakhumelhelha wala woonia toka nihuku attu o Uisraeli vaakhumilhe aya ilhapo yo Umisri nne mpaka ilhelho nna. Nikhalhe, nuupuwelheke, nivahaneke nlhove no uphanga.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Attu o Uisraeli anoowiichesha tayari waatakana ikhoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Attu onkhaye o Uisraeli ukhuma Urdani mpaka Ubeersheba, vamoka ni attu o ilhapo yo Ugileadi, iwani yonkhaye ahokumaana Umizpa, umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Aholhelhi onkhaye o makosho attu o Uisraeli ahokhalha umihoolho wa attu a Nlhuku. Waalhakelhiya wa manyaasikari onkhaye weeta ni mieto avanre ikerero, ari ilaki ncheshe. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Paahi attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini, ahopatta nttenga wo wiira attu akina o ilhapo ya attu o Uisraeli alhe ari anathkumanne Umizpa uwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:3">Paahi attu o Uisraeli yahonkoha nlhopwana Nlawi ulhe wiira, “Nnihimerieke, wowo uwonya uwo waapangenlhe chani?” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Nlawi nlhopwana, owannyawe namitheko nthiyana ulhe ahaakhulha eeraka wiira, “Mii ni namitheko aka nthiyana ulhe nahopiya iwani yo Ugibea, iwani yo attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini wiira narupelhe wowo uhiyu uyo. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Nansho attu o iwani yo Ugibea ahowa uhiyu nkayaarukureria inupa kaarumpe aka, athananaka ukiiva, nkayanruparupiha nthiyana aka uyo wo uhittuna mpaka nkayaamwiiva. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Mii kahokusha ntembo awe, nkakaatupulhacha ikipande ni urweeha u makosho onkhaye a attu o Uisraeli, ukhalhawaya ahopanga ittu yo urushiha ni yo uhilhoka u Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Vano mwaatti attu o Uisraeli, nkohanacheke, ni mwamalhaka mwaamulheke.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Attu onkhaye vamoka nkayeemelhacha ni wiira, “Khaawo ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwihu nohalha uhokolhia unihemani wawe ama uwannyawe. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Cho, phi nohalha ihu uphanga wo attu ao iwani Ugibea. Ninowoopa ikhura yo waavia iphiro yo waakelhelha. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Ninowaathanlha attu elufu imoka wo kila attu khumi. Yayo anookhalha ni ntheko wo waawiihera yoolhia ashikhunanaya vanovara aya ntheko wo waatarusha attu o iwani yo Ugibea wi ilhapo i Nabenyamini, wo uwonya waya ni uhilhoka upannge aya wa attu o Uisraeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Paahi etu, manyaalhopwana onkhaye o Uisraeli ahokumaana vamoka wo nrima mmoka upwaha attu no iwani ya Ugibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Attu o makosho attu o Uisraeli kayaruma attu mpaka kila vakittu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini, yeerachaka wiira, “Chani phi uwonya waani ulha upangilhiye mmilhokoni winyu ulha? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Vanova nnivaheke attu ayo yohilhoka o ilhapo ya Ugibea wiira neeve nu urimeelhiha uwonya ulha ukhuma Uisraeli.” Nansho attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini khayewelhenlhe ashilhoko aya, attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Paahi wahokumaaniya Ugibea uwo, attu o ukhuma kila iwani, wiira aatakanne ni attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini ahokumaana ukhuma iwani aya manyaasikari maelufu makhumi meelhi ni maelufu sita, o wooria uvarelha ikerero, ni attu o iwani yo ugibea aathukumanne vamoka ayo ari attu imia saba vaathanlhiye aya. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Munlhokoni mwa attu aathanlhiye ayo ahokhalha attu imia saba anoovarelha ikerero moono wo wiimonono, kila mmoka ahooria uwonya nlhuku wo manati ni vamuruni wo uhikufia. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Attu o makosho makina a Aisraeli, ahokumaana ni waathanlha attu maelufu imia ncheshe anooria uvara ikerero. Attu onkhaye ari o wooria waatakana ikhoto.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikhoto ni attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Attu o Uisraeli ahorwaa vakittu wo ulhapelha Nlhuku Ubetheli, wowo athananaka uchuwelha nikosho ninohalha uholhelha urwaa uchokholha waatakana ni attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoromolha nikosho ni Nayuda wiira nichokholheke urwaa uwaatakanani ikhoto.<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli nkayaarwacha wichishu, nkayeeshacha nipuro naya vakiviru ni iwani yo Ugibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Attu Uisraeli ahokhuma urwaa waatakana ni attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini vakhiviru ni Ugibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini nkayaakhuma vachereshere iwani yo Ugibea nkayaatakana ni attu o Uisraeli, nkayeevakacha attu o Uisraeli maelufu makhumi meelhi ni elufu piilhi, nenno nihuku nno. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Nansho attu o Uisraeli ahovara nrima, nkayeechesha rata tho wo ikhoto, vakittu veecheshilhe aya tayari nkwaha wo upachera valhe. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli ahorwaa vachulhu, nkayonlhelha Apwiiya nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. Yamalheke nkayaalhepelha Apwiiya Nlhuku yeeraka,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">“Chani nirweeke tho waatakana ni ashilhoko ihu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakulha yeeraka wiira, “Eiyo, nrwaacheke mwaatakaneke ni ayo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Paahi mphingo wa attu o Uisraeli wahokeliya nrima, nkayeesha manyaasikari aya tayari toko chenre aya mpacho. <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Nihuku no nayeelhi attu o Uisraeli nkayaatameriya waatakana ni attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Nenno nihuku no nayelhi nno attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini ahokhuma Ugibea ni waakelhelha attu o Uisraeli, nkayeevakacha attu o Uisraeli maelufu khumi ni maelufu nane. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Attu onkhaye o Uisraeli nkayaarwacha Ubetheli. Nkayaakhalha wowo umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku yonlhaka ni uttuka mpaka uchechilho, ni waakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka cho upahiya vamooroni ni isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Attu o Uisraeli nkayaalhepelha Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira aavahe nlhove. Yeyo ikatema iyo Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku naari wowo Ubetheli uwo. <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Nafiniasi anaaya Naeleazari, anaaya Naharuni arii ni ntheko wo uphanga umihoolho waya. Attu o Uisraeli nkayaakhoha Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira, “Chani nirweeke tho waatakana ni ashilhoko ihu, attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha wiira, “Nrweeke mwaatakaneke. Meelho kinowaakottolhacha.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli nkayeeshacha attu univithoni urukureriya iwani yo Ugibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Attu o Uisraeli nkayaarwaa waatakana ni attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini nihuku no neraru. Nkayeechesha tayari uweha iwani yo Ugibea thoko chaapangilhe aya mpacho. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Yamalheke attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini vaakhumilhe aya vawani uchokholha waatakana ni attu o Uisraeli, ahopurulhiya ukhuma vachereshere iwani. Yahokhumelha tho thoko chaapangilhe aya mpacho nkayeeva attu o israeli akina ari iphiro yulhupalhe inokelhelha iwani yo Ubetheli ni Ugibea, mpaka uthakoni. Yaheeva attu o Uisraeli khumi mararu. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini nkayoopuwelha wiira, “Nihaata thoko ikatema chivinre.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:32">Nansho attu o Uisraeli nkeera, “Nittaweke etu, wiira naapurulhelhe utayi ni iwani mpaka uri iphiro yuulhupalhe.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Paahi etu attu o Uisraeli onkhaye ahothamacha vakittu waya ni ukhalha tho Ubaaltamari. Ashikhunanaya eevithilhe ayo ahothamacha wo waakuvia vakittu veevithilhe aya vawo ni urwaa mpata uneelha nchuwa wo iwani ya Ugibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Manyaasikari o machiri aathanlhiye ukhuma makosho onkhaye a attu o Uisraeli nkayaawacha vavawo umihoolho yo iwani o Ugibea. Ikhoto yo nihuku nno yahokhalha yo uviha mooro. Nansho attu o ilhapo i Nabenyamini khayaachuwenlhe wiira urimeelha waya waari vakhiviru. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakottolha attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini umihoolho wa attu o Uisraeli. Attu o Uisraeli nkayeevakacha attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini ilaki piilhi ni maelufu nthanu ni imia imoka. Yayo onkhaye eeviye ayo ari manyaasikari o wooria uvarelha ikerero. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Paahi attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini nkayoona wiira ahokottolhiya.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JDG 20:36">Chenre aya attu o Uisraeli wo ukottolha</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Attu o Uisraeli nkayaahokolhia utulhi thoko anaattawa attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini, kwaani yaari aakhulhuvelhaka ashikunanaya ari aneevinthe ukelhelha iwani yo Ugibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Yayo attu ayo ahottawa wo waakuvia uthama ni ukelhelha iwani yo Ugibea ni weevakacha attu onkhaye yaariwo wo uphanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Yaari aneewananne ni attu o Uisraeli akina iphiro yo nthonyero mmoka. Yeewananne wiira attu eevithilhe alhe vanohalha aya woona mwiishi mwinchi uwelhaka nchulhu ukhuma vawani, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />paahi akellhelheke iwani iyo. Yeyo ikatema iyo attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini ari tayari aneevakachilhe attu makhumi mararu o ilhapo ya attu o Uisraeli ni uwerelha wiira, “Nihaakottolha thoko mpacho vawo.”<verse eid="JDG 20:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Nansho wo nthonyero no nipoto no mwiishi nne vachokhonlhe aya ukhumelha iwani, attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini vaawenhe aya utulhi, nkayaathikina woona wiira iwani aya yaari inapahiye mooro. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli ahorukunuwa, ni attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini nkayaakelhiya ni ittu yo ushangiha kwaani vano ahoona wiira urimeelha waya uhaatameria. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Paahi ahorukunuwacha nkayaatawa attu o Uisraeli ni ukelha uthakwani, nansho ikhoto nkayaaphwanya, nkayaakhalha variyari yo miphingo piilhi cha attu o Uisraeli, ni manyaasikari aathamme ahorimeelhihachiya. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Attu o Uisraeli ahaarukureria attu o ilhapo i Nabenyamini mipatta chonkhaye ni woomolha, ni wanyikhalhacha mpaka mpata unosha nchuwa wo Ugibea, ni weevakacha attu enchi. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Nenno nihuku nno attu maelufu khumi ni maelufu nane o nikosho ni Nabenyamini, onkhaye manyaasikari aheevakachiya. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Yamalheke attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini akina ahorukunuwa, nkayaattawa arwaachaka uthakoni mpaka umwalhani Urimoni. Attu akina maelufu nthanu aheeviya urii iphiro yulhupalhe vaari aya attawaka. Attu o Uisraeli nkayaathepa waatwarelhelha wo machiri attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini mpaka iwani yo Ugibea nkayeevakacha attu maelufu meelhi. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Attu onkhaye o nikosho ni Nabenyamini yeeviye nenno nihuku nno arii maelufu khumi ni meelhi ni maelufu nthanu, manyaasikari o uchuwelha uvarelha ikerero rata.<verse eid="JDG 20:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Nansho manyaalhopwana imia sita o nikosho ni Nabenyamini aholhapuwa ni uttawelha uthakoni mpaka urii mwalha wo Urimini, nkayaakhalha wowo wo mieri micheshe. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Yamalheke attu o Uisraeli ahaarukunuwelha attu akina o nikosho ni Nabenyamini, nkayeevakacha onkhaye: Manyaalhopwana, manyaathiyana ni achishana ni ashinama. Ni iwani yonkhaye yaaphwanyilhe aya wowo nkayaarimeelhihiya wo upahiya mooro.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Manyaathiyana a attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli vaakumanne aya Umizpa aholhupelhacha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira: “Khaawo ata mmoka ihu nohalha unvekiha mwaamwanawe mwanthiyana wa attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli ahorwaacha mpaka Ubetheli nkayaakhalha wowo umihoolho wa Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. Nkayaakhuwelhacha onlhaka wo nlhatu no urushiya chinene yeeraka, <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />“Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli, chani nlhatuni no unikhumelhelha yelha ittu ilha, ata nikosho na attu o Uisraeli niwukuwe munlhokoni wihu?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Waashelhe waya attu ahonkwacha wichishuru, nkayaatheka madhubahu nkayakhumiha isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Yamalheke nkayaakohanacha yeeraka, “Chani mmilhokoni wa attu o nikosho nonkhaye na attu o Uisraeli uhawo nlhoko uriyoothe uhiwilhe vakumanne ihu umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku va?” Ukhalhawaya aholhupelha wiira ntu riyoothe hinophiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku Umizpa uwo yoyo eeviyeke. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Nansho attu o Uisraeli nkayoonelha ikiriri ashilhoko aya o nikosho ni Nabenyamini, nkeera wiira, “Lhelho nikosho nimoka na attu o Uisraeli nihorimeelha. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Vano ninohalha uphanga ittu yaani wiira naavahe manyaathiyana alha ashilhopwana o nikosho ni Nabenyamini ahalhenlhe alha? Ukhalhawaya naholhupelha wo nchina na Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira khaninaavekiha achishana ihu ashithiyana akhalhache manyaahanu aya!”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Vaathananne aya uchuwelha yakhalhaka wahaawo nlhoko uriwoothe wo nikosho na attu o Uisraeli uhiwiilhe vanokumaaniya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku vawo Umizpa uwo, nkayaachuwelha wiira khaariwo ntu riyoothe ukhuma Uyabeshgileadi aawiilhe vanokumaaniya vawo. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Ukhalhawaya attu vaalhakelhiye aya, khaariwo ata ntu mmoka o Uyabeshgileadi. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Paahi nlhoko wa attu o Uisraeli wahaarweeha attu o machiri chinene maelufu khumi ni maelufu meelhi, ni weerelha, “Nrweeke mweevakacheke attu o Uyabeshgileadi, manyaahithiyaana vamoka ni achishana aya. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Mweevakacheke manyaalhopwana onkhaye ni manyaathiyana ashithiyana onkhaye athuphanche mooro.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Paahi nkayaapwanya mmilhokoni wa attu o Uyabeshgileadi imialhi imia ncheshe o uhithupha mooro, nkayaarweha unipuroni Ushilo, ilhapo yo Ukanaani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Yamalheke nlhoko wonkhaye wahorweeha nttenga wo mpuha wa attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini ari umwalhani Urimoni. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Yayo manyaalhopwana o nikosho ni Nabenyamini nkayahokolhelha ashikunana aya ayo yeyo ikatema. Paahi nkaavahiya ashithiyana aawihachiye ukhuma Uyabeshgileadi uwo alhe. Nansho ashithiyana ayo kaathonshe.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Attu o Uisraeli nkayoonelha ikiriri attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahohiya ukhalhe ni mwiinano munlhokoni mwa attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Yamalhekeru ashulhupalhe a attu onkhaye nkayeeracha wiira, “Vano ninohalha uphanga ittu yaani wiira naavahe manyaathiyana ashilhopwana aahanlhe, ukhalhawaya ashithiyana onkhaye o nikosho ni Nabenyamini ahorimeelhacha? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Iri lazima ashilhopwana aahanlhe o nikosho ni Nabenyamini avahiye manyaathiyana wiira nihipotere nikosho nirinoothe na attu o Uisraeli, ni nikosho na attu o Ubenyamini nunchererie. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Nansho khaninooria waakumiha achishana ihu akhalhache manyaahanu aya, ukhalhawaya naholhupelha wiira ntu riyoothe nohalha unvekiha mwaamwanawe mwanthiyana wa manyaalhopwana o nikosho ni Nabenyamini alhaviyeke.”<verse eid="JDG 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Paahi nkayoopuwelha wiira isikukuu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku inopangiya kila iyaakha Ushilo uwo, iwani irii mpata wo uchulhu wo Ubetheli, wi iwani iri iphiro yuulhupalhe inokhuma Ubetheli urwaa Ushekemu, yaari inaatamenrie. <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Paahi etu, nkayaalhehera manyaalhopwana o nikosho ni Nabenyamini alhe wiira, “Nrwaacheke mweethelheke nu wiivitha mmamatani mwo izabibu, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />mwakhalheke miitho. Ashithiyana o Ushilo vanokhuma aya vathe uthwelha ikatema yo isikukuu, nkhumeke umizabibuni ni kila ntu akusheke mwalhi mmoka akhalheke ahanu awe. Yamalhaka nhokolhieke wiilhaponi u Nabenyamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Manyathumwanaya ama ashirokoraya awaaka unichukhulhelhani ninooweerelha wiira, ‘Hii ninoulhepelhani wiira mwoonelhe ikiriri attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini, mwaahiyereke aakusheke ashithiyana ayo, ukhalhawaya khanaapattilhe ukhotoni Uyabeshgileadi. Ni ukhalhawaya mwaatti mwaashinene khanivahilhe achishana inyu ayo, kannohukhumulhiya.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Ashilhopwana o nikosho ni Nabenyamini alhe nkayaapanga chiichammo, kila mmoka kayeethanlhiya mwaalhi mmilhokoni wa ashithiyana akumme vathe utwelhani Ushilo uwo ni unkusha akalheke ahanu awe. Yamalheke kayahokholhiacha vakittu wawe, kayaatheka iwani yonanano ni ukhalha wowo. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Ikatema ya attu o Uisraeli kayaathamacha, kila ntu kayahokholhi aya vakittu o nikosho naya ni ashilhoko aya. Kila ntu ahohokholhiya vakittu vameelhiye awe.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Paahi yayo mahuku ayo khaariwo mwene o nikosho na attu o Uisraeli. Ni kila ntu ahopanga thoko choonilhe awe.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>